(1467942742525056,1467942629688448,16,'assistant',NULL,'I need to determine how to identify \"公告\" (announcement) content. There\'s no dedicated notice table. Likely announcements are stored in lm_cms_content under a channel named 公告, or MODEL_ID corresponding to 公告 model in lm_cms_model. Let me check lm_cms_model.\n\nSince data is masked, I can\'t see actual values. But I can still write SQL. Let me check lm_cms_model schema and relationships.\n\nAlternative: lm_cms_content.CONTENT_TYPE or PROJECT_TYPE may indicate 公告. Let me check lm_cms_model table and lm_cms_channel_ext.\n\nAlso check lm_parameter / lm_jg_dict_data for 公告 dict.\n\nLet me get schemas.\n','[{\"id\":\"call_e533a2904fd44e64a9ce161b\",\"name\":\"get_table_schema\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"tables\\\": \\n[\\\"lm_cms_model\\\", \\\"lm_cms_site\\\"]\\n\\n}\"},{\"id\":\"call_fbf3e88dfa82440590cc1895\",\"name\":\"get_table_relationships\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"tables\\\": \\n[\\\"lm_cms_content\\\", \\\"lm_cms_channel\\\", \\\"lm_cms_model\\\"]\\n\\n}\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,5960,230,1467891621250176,'2026-09-05 23:37:09'),
