(1467947458929792,1467942629688448,33,'assistant',NULL,'The user asks: \"我当前连接的是哪个库？\" — which database am I connected to. I should answer from the connection info. Maybe I can verify with run_sql SELECT DATABASE(). Let me do that quickly.\n\nNote the earlier query results are masked, but SELECT DATABASE() would return a string — likely masked as `<str:...>`. Let me try anyway; it may still show. Actually the note says data is masked (allow_sample_data: false). So it may return placeholder. I can still answer from connection info: 连接名 测试库, 实例 lemon_demo, MySQL.\n\nLet me run SELECT DATABASE(), VERSION() to be helpful.','[{\"id\":\"call_00a157ce661147a68da21d16\",\"name\":\"run_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"purpose\\\": \\\"确认当前数据库与版本\\\", \\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT DATABASE() AS 当前库, VERSION() AS 版本, @@hostname AS 主机, USER() AS 登录用户\\\"}\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,9358,206,1467891621250176,'2026-09-05 23:46:45'),
