(1467947575903360,1467942629688448,35,'assistant',NULL,'The connection is not allowed to read real data, so results are masked. I can tell from the system prompt: 数据库类型 MySQL, 连接名 测试库, 实例名 lemon_demo. The DATABASE() returned a 10-char string — likely \"lemon_demo\" (10 chars). But I shouldn\'t assert masked data. I can state from connection info.\n\nAlso I should continue the original task afterwards. Let me answer the question and note the pending task.\n\nLet me answer concisely: 当前连接 MySQL 实例 lemon_demo，连接名\"测试库\"；库名从 DATABASE() 返回（被脱敏，长度10字符，与实例名 lemon_demo 一致）。表前缀 lm_，共 123 张表。\n\nThen mention the 公告统计 task is still pending — I need to confirm which channel is 公告 since data is masked. Ask? Better: proceed with a reasonable default and note warnings. Actually the previous query results were masked so I can\'t determine which naming matched. I should just produce the chart with a robust SQL that covers 公告/通知 naming, and note in warnings.\n\nBut the user\'s current message is just a question. I\'ll answer it, and offer to continue. Actually rules say don\'t ask unless necessary; but here the current turn is a direct question. I\'ll answer and then finish the chart task with a robust SQL.\n\nLet me first verify the robust SQL runs.\n','[{\"id\":\"call_04e8e2a9d40043fc97a1cca6\",\"name\":\"run_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"purpose\\\": \\\"验证兼容命名的每年公告统计SQL\\\", \\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT YEAR(COALESCE(cc.RELEASE_TIME, cc.CREATE_TIME)) AS `年份`,\\\\n       COUNT(*) AS `发布数量`\\\\nFROM lm_cms_content cc\\\\nJOIN lm_cms_channel ch ON cc.CHANNEL_ID = ch.ID\\\\nWHERE cc.DEL_FLAG = 0\\\\n  AND COALESCE(ch.DEL_FLAG,0) = 0\\\\n  AND (ch.CHANNEL_NAME LIKE \'%公告%\' OR ch.CHANNEL_NAME LIKE \'%通知%\' OR ch.CHANNEL_PATH LIKE \'%notice%\')\\\\n  AND COALESCE(cc.RELEASE_TIME, cc.CREATE_TIME) IS NOT NULL\\\\nGROUP BY YEAR(COALESCE(cc.RELEASE_TIME, cc.CREATE_TIME))\\\\nORDER BY `年份`\\\"}\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,9538,499,1467891621250176,'2026-09-05 23:46:59'),
