(1467948268217472,1467942629688448,39,'assistant',NULL,'User says \"不用区分子栏目\" — don\'t distinguish sub-channels. So they want overall content publish count per year, without filtering by channel. Let me write SQL grouping by year over lm_cms_content with DEL_FLAG = 0, using COALESCE(RELEASE_TIME, CREATE_TIME).\n\nLet me verify with run_sql first.\n\nActually, \"不用区分子栏目\" could mean: count all announcements regardless of channel — i.e., just count all content per year. Let\'s do that. Maybe also break down by year with count.\n\nLet me run the SQL.','[{\"id\":\"call_e9355760def34ff1af43404b\",\"name\":\"run_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"purpose\\\": \\\"验证每年发布数量（不区分子栏目）\\\", \\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT YEAR(COALESCE(RELEASE_TIME, CREATE_TIME)) AS `年份`,\\\\n       COUNT(*) AS `发布数量`\\\\nFROM lm_cms_content\\\\nWHERE DEL_FLAG = 0\\\\n  AND COALESCE(RELEASE_TIME, CREATE_TIME) IS NOT NULL\\\\nGROUP BY YEAR(COALESCE(RELEASE_TIME, CREATE_TIME))\\\\nORDER BY `年份`\\\", \\\"maxRows\\\": 50}\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,10229,258,1467891621250176,'2026-09-05 23:48:24'),
