(1468573613245568,1468573515834496,8,'assistant',NULL,'Now let me look at the data to understand enum values: DEL_FLAG semantics, PROJECT_TYPE values, DISPLAY values, site_key values. Let me sample rows.\n\nNote: lm_cms_site schema got truncated; I need site_key, site_path fields. Let me get that table schema alone.\n\nAlso, the user\'s SQL has duplicate alias \"所属站点\" twice (lcc.SITE_ID and lcm.SITE_ID) — MySQL allows duplicate column aliases in result, so it\'s fine but could be confusing. I might rename.\n\nLet\'s sample data.\n','[{\"id\":\"call_69308699f9104d8681d94517\",\"name\":\"get_table_schema\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"tables\\\": \\n[\\\"lm_cms_site\\\"]\\n\\n}\"},{\"id\":\"call_3383338403a6445a98c11acb\",\"name\":\"sample_rows\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"table\\\": \\\"lm_cms_channel\\\", \\\"columns\\\": \\n[\\\"ID\\\", \\\"CHANNEL_NAME\\\", \\\"CHANNEL_PATH\\\", \\\"SITE_ID\\\", \\\"MODEL_ID\\\", \\\"DEL_FLAG\\\", \\\"DISPLAY\\\"]\\n\\n}\"},{\"id\":\"call_be85bed6ab78494b9481dc25\",\"name\":\"sample_rows\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"table\\\": \\\"lm_cms_content\\\", \\\"columns\\\": \\n[\\\"ID\\\", \\\"TITLE\\\", \\\"CHANNEL_ID\\\", \\\"PROJECT_CODE\\\", \\\"PROJECT_TYPE\\\", \\\"DEL_FLAG\\\", \\\"SITE_ID\\\", \\\"MODEL_ID\\\"]\\n\\n}\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,5612,287,1467891621250176,'2026-09-06 21:00:40'),
