(1468573823853696,1468573515834496,20,'assistant',NULL,'Interesting: model has DEL_FLAG non-zero rows. So excluding deleted models matters (INNER JOIN on model would still include deleted models).\n\nLet me check what DEL_FLAG values exist (0 vs 1 vs 2). Run a distinct query — but values masked. We can test with a count: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM lm_cms_model WHERE DEL_FLAG = 1 vs = 2. rowCount tells us. Actually rowCount is number of rows returned; if I do SELECT DEL_FLAG ... GROUP BY, values are masked. Instead use conditional: SELECT 1 FROM lm_cms_model WHERE DEL_FLAG = 2 LIMIT 1 → rowCount 0 or 1 tells existence.\n\nLet\'s check values 1 and 2 quickly.\n\nAlso, the user\'s request: \"请根据当前勾选字段帮我写筛选条件（WHERE / HAVING）\" — they want filter conditions based on the selected fields. This is a bit vague: they want a WHERE clause template with conditions on the chosen fields. Best deliverable: complete SQL with sensible, parameterized filter conditions (site, channel name fuzzy, model name, project type, title keyword, etc.), plus commented-out optional conditions. Since it\'s a preview/list query (no aggregation), HAVING isn\'t needed — note that.\n\nAlso fix issues in the current SQL:\n1. Duplicate alias 所属站点 (lcc.SITE_ID and lcm.SITE_ID both AS 所属站点) — ambiguous column alias; should rename.\n2. Missing del_flag filters.\n3. lcs.id AS 主键 — fine.\n4. LEFT JOIN content means channels without content appear; if filtering on content fields in WHERE, LEFT JOIN semantics break → put content conditions in ON or use conditional logic. Important note: if user adds TITLE/PROJECT_CODE filters in WHERE, the LEFT JOIN degenerates to INNER. Provide guidance: keep content filters in ON clause to preserve empty channels, or move to WHERE if only want matching content.\n\nLet me verify the final SQL runs, and check DEL_FLAG values.\n\nAlso check whether lm_cms_site.site_status filter is relevant — but site_status isn\'t in selected fields. Keep optional commented.\n\nLet me check DEL_FLAG = 1 vs 2 existence for model, and also verify content SITE_ID type mismatch (bigint vs varchar) — not needed.\n\nLet me run the final SQL.','[{\"id\":\"call_c4ef22bbaa9948aca8089428\",\"name\":\"run_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"purpose\\\": \\\"确认 lm_cms_model 已删除数据用的是哪个 DEL_FLAG 值（=1 是否存在）\\\", \\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT ID FROM lemon_cms.lm_cms_model WHERE DEL_FLAG = 1 LIMIT 1\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"call_cef20d095b11427fb5e7c6ec\",\"name\":\"run_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"purpose\\\": \\\"确认 lm_cms_model 是否存在 DEL_FLAG=2 的数据\\\", \\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT ID FROM lemon_cms.lm_cms_model WHERE DEL_FLAG = 2 LIMIT 1\\\"}\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,7412,637,1467891621250176,'2026-09-06 21:01:06'),
