(1468573892658304,1468573515834496,23,'assistant',NULL,'So DEL_FLAG=2 means deleted in this system (RuoYi convention: 0=正常, 2=删除). Good — filter should be `DEL_FLAG = 0` or `IFNULL(DEL_FLAG,0)=0`.\n\nNow let me write the final SQL with WHERE conditions. Key design:\n- 排除软删除：lm_cms_model.DEL_FLAG = 0（实际有 2 的数据，必须过滤，否则 INNER JOIN 会带出已删模型）\n- lm_cms_channel.DEL_FLAG = 0, lm_cms_site.del_flag = 0（当前无脏数据，但防御性保留）\n- lm_cms_content 是 LEFT JOIN → 软删除条件必须放在 ON 里，否则 LEFT JOIN 退化为 INNER JOIN。这是关键点，要写进说明。\n- 参数化占位：站点标识 site_key、栏目名称模糊、标题模糊、项目编号、项目类型、模型名称/路径。\n\nAlso fix: 别名重复 \"所属站点\" 出现两次（lcc.SITE_ID 和 lcm.SITE_ID），以及 lcs.id AS 主键 — 建议改别名，但用户只要筛选条件。我会顺手给可读别名（可选）。保持勾选字段不变，只补 WHERE。我会稍微调整别名避免重名？用户说\"根据当前勾选字段帮我写筛选条件\"，所以主要给 WHERE。我保留字段列表原样，但把重复别名改成有区分度（说明中提出）。嗯，改名可能影响下游。我保留原字段，仅在 explanation 里提示别名重复。实际上重复列名在结果集里会冲突，MySQL 允许但结果集有两列同名。建议改，但作为 warnings 提出，不改用户选中的字段。\n\nHmm, but propose_sql with replaceSelection=true would replace user\'s SQL. I\'ll keep their field list intact and add WHERE. Let me verify full SQL runs.\n\nAlso add a HAVING example? There\'s no GROUP BY, so HAVING doesn\'t apply. I\'ll mention that.\n\nLet me also consider: 内容发布时间范围 RELEASE_TIME — 未勾选字段但常用于筛选。I\'ll include commented-out optional lines.\n\nLet me write and validate.','[{\"id\":\"call_637310d55bf346409dc7ac29\",\"name\":\"run_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"purpose\\\": \\\"验证加了筛选条件的完整 SQL\\\", \\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT\\\\n  lcc.CHANNEL_NAME AS 栏目名称,\\\\n  lcc.CHANNEL_PATH AS 栏目路径,\\\\n  lcc.SITE_ID AS 所属站点,\\\\n  lcc.MODEL_ID AS 模型,\\\\n  lcc2.CHANNEL_ID AS 所属栏目,\\\\n  lcc2.TITLE AS 标题,\\\\n  lcc2.PROJECT_CODE AS 项目编号,\\\\n  lcc2.PROJECT_TYPE AS 项目类型,\\\\n  lcm.MODEL_PATH AS 模型路径,\\\\n  lcm.MODEL_NAME AS 模型名称,\\\\n  lcm.SITE_ID AS 模型所属站点,\\\\n  lcs.site_name AS 站点名称,\\\\n  lcs.id AS 站点主键,\\\\n  lcs.site_path AS 站点资源路径,\\\\n  lcs.site_key AS 站点标识\\\\nFROM lemon_cms.lm_cms_channel lcc\\\\n  INNER JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_model lcm ON lcm.ID = lcc.MODEL_ID AND IFNULL(lcm.DEL_FLAG,0) = 0\\\\n  INNER JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_site lcs ON lcs.id = lcc.SITE_ID AND IFNULL(lcs.del_flag,0) = 0\\\\n  LEFT JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_content lcc2 ON lcc2.CHANNEL_ID = lcc.ID AND IFNULL(lcc2.DEL_FLAG,0) = 0\\\\nWHERE IFNULL(lcc.DEL_FLAG,0) = 0\\\\n  AND lcc2.ID IS NOT NULL\\\\n  AND lcs.site_key = \'main\'\\\\n  AND lcc.CHANNEL_NAME LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'测试\', \'%\')\\\\n  AND lcc.CHANNEL_PATH LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'/a\', \'%\')\\\\n  AND lcm.MODEL_NAME LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'文章\', \'%\')\\\\n  AND lcc2.TITLE LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'公告\', \'%\')\\\\n  AND lcc2.PROJECT_CODE LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'XM\', \'%\')\\\\n  AND lcc2.PROJECT_TYPE = \'01\'\\\\nORDER BY lcs.id, lcc.ORDER_NUM, lcc2.RELEASE_TIME DESC\\\\nLIMIT 1000\\\"}\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,7678,970,1467891621250176,'2026-09-06 21:01:14'),
