(1468573993829504,1468573515834496,27,'assistant',NULL,'Good — base query works. Now I\'ll produce the final SQL with a commented-out filter template so user can enable conditions. Also fix duplicate alias 所属站点 (lcc.SITE_ID and lcm.SITE_ID both named 所属站点 — MySQL allows duplicate aliases but better to distinguish). And \"主键\" alias for lcs.id.\n\nLet me craft final SQL: keep base structure + soft-delete filters, and provide the parameterized filter block with `:param` style placeholders? Better: use \"AND (? IS NULL OR ...)\" style? For MySQL client, simplest is commented lines with literal placeholders. I\'ll write conditions using COALESCE-safe patterns with variables set at top? Keep it simple: provide commented WHERE block with ready-to-uncomment lines.\n\nActually the user asked: \"请根据当前勾选字段帮我写筛选条件（WHERE / HAVING）\". So deliver a full SQL with a filter template covering all checked fields, using `AND (? IS NULL OR col LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', ?, \'%\'))` — that requires params. Simpler and more practical: write conditions with literal example values and comments, so user replaces values. I\'ll do that but keep the query runnable (all optional filters commented out) so run_sql passes.\n\nLet me produce final SQL with:\n- WHERE IFNULL(lcc.DEL_FLAG,0)=0 AND IFNULL(lcm.DEL_FLAG,0)=0 AND IFNULL(lcs.del_flag,0)=0 and content soft-delete in ON clause\n- optional filters commented with -- prefix, one per checked field\n- a note about HAVING: no aggregation, so HAVING not needed; if they want to filter only channels having content, use EXISTS subquery or GROUP BY + HAVING COUNT.\n\nAlso provide a HAVING variant: group by channel and having count(content)>0. I\'ll mention in explanation.\n\nLet me verify the final commented version runs.\n','[{\"id\":\"call_4f9eb3591d474824a7484711\",\"name\":\"run_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"purpose\\\": \\\"验证最终交付 SQL（含注释形式的可选筛选条件）\\\", \\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT\\\\n  lcs.site_name AS 站点名称,\\\\n  lcs.id AS 站点主键,\\\\n  lcs.site_key AS 站点标识,\\\\n  lcs.site_path AS 站点资源路径,\\\\n  lcc.CHANNEL_NAME AS 栏目名称,\\\\n  lcc.CHANNEL_PATH AS 栏目路径,\\\\n  lcc.SITE_ID AS 栏目所属站点,\\\\n  lcc.MODEL_ID AS 栏目模型,\\\\n  lcm.MODEL_NAME AS 模型名称,\\\\n  lcm.MODEL_PATH AS 模型路径,\\\\n  lcm.SITE_ID AS 模型所属站点,\\\\n  lcc2.CHANNEL_ID AS 所属栏目,\\\\n  lcc2.TITLE AS 标题,\\\\n  lcc2.PROJECT_CODE AS 项目编号,\\\\n  lcc2.PROJECT_TYPE AS 项目类型\\\\nFROM lemon_cms.lm_cms_channel lcc\\\\n  INNER JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_model lcm\\\\n          ON lcm.ID = lcc.MODEL_ID AND IFNULL(lcm.DEL_FLAG, 0) = 0\\\\n  INNER JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_site lcs\\\\n          ON lcs.id = lcc.SITE_ID AND IFNULL(lcs.del_flag, 0) = 0\\\\n  LEFT JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_content lcc2\\\\n          ON lcc2.CHANNEL_ID = lcc.ID AND IFNULL(lcc2.DEL_FLAG, 0) = 0\\\\nWHERE IFNULL(lcc.DEL_FLAG, 0) = 0\\\\n  -- ========== 站点 lm_cms_site ==========\\\\n  -- AND lcs.site_name LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'示例站点\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcs.id = 1\\\\n  -- AND lcs.site_key = \'main\'\\\\n  -- AND lcs.site_path LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'/upload\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- ========== 栏目 lm_cms_channel ==========\\\\n  -- AND lcc.CHANNEL_NAME LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'新闻\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcc.CHANNEL_PATH LIKE \'/news%\'\\\\n  -- AND lcc.SITE_ID IN (\'1\', \'2\')\\\\n  -- AND lcc.MODEL_ID IN (1, 2)\\\\n  -- ========== 模型 lm_cms_model ==========\\\\n  -- AND lcm.MODEL_NAME LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'文章\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcm.MODEL_PATH LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'article\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcm.SITE_ID = lcs.id\\\\n  -- ========== 内容 lm_cms_content（写在 ON 里则保留空栏目；写在 WHERE 里等价于只看有内容栏目） ==========\\\\n  -- AND lcc2.TITLE LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'公告\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcc2.PROJECT_CODE LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'XM2024\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcc2.PROJECT_TYPE IN (\'01\', \'02\')\\\\n  -- AND lcc2.CHANNEL_ID = 10\\\\nORDER BY lcs.id, lcc.ORDER_NUM, lcc2.RELEASE_TIME DESC\\\\nLIMIT 1000\\\"}\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,8547,1095,1467891621250176,'2026-09-06 21:01:26'),
