(1468574149903488,1468573515834496,29,'assistant','已核对 4 张表结构与关系画布的 JOIN 条件，并用 run_sql 验证通过（返回 45 行）。\n\n几点关键结论：\n- 4 张表都有软删除标记：`lm_cms_channel.DEL_FLAG` / `lm_cms_content.DEL_FLAG` / `lm_cms_model.DEL_FLAG` / `lm_cms_site.del_flag`。实测 `lm_cms_model` 存在 `DEL_FLAG=2` 的记录（=1 无），所以模型表**必须**过滤，否则会带出已删模型。\n- 内容表是 `LEFT JOIN`：筛选条件放 `ON` 里保留“无内容的栏目”，放 `WHERE` 里则退化为只看有内容的栏目 —— 下面按可切换的方式给出。\n- 本查询没有 `GROUP BY`，所以用不上 `HAVING`；若要“只看内容数 > N 的栏目”，需改成聚合写法（见 explanation）。\n- 原 SQL 里 `lcc.SITE_ID` 与 `lcm.SITE_ID` 都叫“所属站点”，已分别改名为「栏目所属站点 / 模型所属站点」。\n\n','SQL runs fine. Now propose final SQL with commented optional filters, plus a \"示例：全部启用\" version? Keep one final SQL with commented conditions (safest, no guessing values). Also fix duplicate alias 所属站点 (lcc.SITE_ID and lcm.SITE_ID both aliased 所属站点) — MySQL allows duplicate aliases but it\'s confusing; I renamed them.\n\nAlso note HAVING usage: since no GROUP BY in this query, HAVING isn\'t applicable — mention that; provide optional aggregate variant in explanation.\n\nWarnings: values are placeholders; lm_cms_model has DEL_FLAG=2 rows so soft-delete filter matters; content filter in WHERE vs ON.\n\nLet me finalize.','[{\"id\":\"call_81c284e0354e48ed9a2bfe8f\",\"name\":\"propose_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT\\\\n  -- ========== 站点 lm_cms_site ==========\\\\n  lcs.site_name                AS 站点名称,\\\\n  lcs.id                       AS 站点主键,\\\\n  lcs.site_key                 AS 站点标识,\\\\n  lcs.site_path                AS 站点资源路径,\\\\n  -- ========== 栏目 lm_cms_channel ==========\\\\n  lcc.CHANNEL_NAME             AS 栏目名称,\\\\n  lcc.CHANNEL_PATH             AS 栏目路径,\\\\n  lcc.SITE_ID                  AS 栏目所属站点,\\\\n  lcc.MODEL_ID                 AS 栏目模型,\\\\n  -- ========== 模型 lm_cms_model ==========\\\\n  lcm.MODEL_NAME               AS 模型名称,\\\\n  lcm.MODEL_PATH               AS 模型路径,\\\\n  lcm.SITE_ID                  AS 模型所属站点,\\\\n  -- ========== 内容 lm_cms_content ==========\\\\n  lcc2.CHANNEL_ID              AS 所属栏目,\\\\n  lcc2.TITLE                   AS 标题,\\\\n  lcc2.PROJECT_CODE            AS 项目编号,\\\\n  lcc2.PROJECT_TYPE            AS 项目类型\\\\nFROM lemon_cms.lm_cms_channel lcc\\\\n  INNER JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_model lcm\\\\n          ON lcm.ID = lcc.MODEL_ID\\\\n         AND IFNULL(lcm.DEL_FLAG, 0) = 0          -- 模型软删除（库中存在 DEL_FLAG=2 的记录）\\\\n  INNER JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_site lcs\\\\n          ON lcs.id = lcc.SITE_ID\\\\n         AND IFNULL(lcs.del_flag, 0) = 0          -- 站点软删除\\\\n  LEFT JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_content lcc2\\\\n          ON lcc2.CHANNEL_ID = lcc.ID\\\\n         AND IFNULL(lcc2.DEL_FLAG, 0) = 0         -- 内容软删除\\\\nWHERE IFNULL(lcc.DEL_FLAG, 0) = 0                 -- 栏目软删除\\\\n  -- ========== 以下为按需勾选的筛选条件（取消注释并替换示例值） ==========\\\\n  -- 【站点】\\\\n  -- AND lcs.site_name LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'示例站点\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcs.id = 1\\\\n  -- AND lcs.site_key = \'main\'\\\\n  -- AND lcs.site_path LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'/upload\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- 【栏目】\\\\n  -- AND lcc.CHANNEL_NAME LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'新闻\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcc.CHANNEL_PATH LIKE \'/news%\'\\\\n  -- AND lcc.SITE_ID IN (\'1\', \'2\')\\\\n  -- AND lcc.MODEL_ID IN (1, 2)\\\\n  -- 【模型】\\\\n  -- AND lcm.MODEL_NAME LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'文章\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcm.MODEL_PATH LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'article\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcm.SITE_ID = lcc.SITE_ID                -- 只保留模型与栏目同站点的组合\\\\n  -- 【内容】写在 WHERE 中 => 只返回“有匹配内容”的栏目行\\\\n  -- AND lcc2.TITLE LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'公告\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcc2.PROJECT_CODE LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'XM2024\', \'%\')\\\\n  -- AND lcc2.PROJECT_TYPE IN (\'01\', \'02\')\\\\n  -- AND lcc2.CHANNEL_ID = 10\\\\n  -- 【内容】若希望保留无内容的栏目，把上面几条内容条件移到 LEFT JOIN 的 ON 里，\\\\n  --        或用这一行替代： AND (lcc2.ID IS NULL OR lcc2.PROJECT_TYPE IN (\'01\',\'02\'))\\\\nORDER BY lcs.id, lcc.ORDER_NUM, lcc2.RELEASE_TIME DESC\\\\nLIMIT 1000\\\", \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"思路：以栏目 lm_cms_channel 为主表，按关系画布中配置的权威关联补齐模型、站点、内容三表——lm_cms_channel.MODEL_ID = lm_cms_model.ID（INNER）、lm_cms_channel.SITE_ID = lm_cms_site.id（INNER）、lm_cms_content.CHANNEL_ID = lm_cms_channel.ID（LEFT，保留空栏目）。\\\\n\\\\n筛选条件设计：\\\\n1) 必备条件（已启用）：四张表的软删除标记统一按 IFNULL(DEL_FLAG/del_flag,0)=0 排除。实测 lm_cms_model 存在 DEL_FLAG=2 的历史数据，其余三表当前无已删数据，但保留条件更稳妥。\\\\n2) 可选条件（注释形式给出，覆盖你勾选的全部 15 个字段）：文本类字段用 LIKE CONCAT(\'%\',?,\'%\') 便于模糊搜索；主键/外键类（lcs.id、lcc.SITE_ID、lcc.MODEL_ID、lcc2.CHANNEL_ID）用 = 或 IN；枚举类 PROJECT_TYPE 用 IN。\\\\n3) 内容表条件的位置决定语义：放 WHERE → 结果只包含“有匹配内容”的栏目（LEFT JOIN 退化为 INNER）；放 ON → 仍输出无内容的栏目（标题等列为 NULL）。需要“必须能匹配到内容”时可加 AND lcc2.ID IS NOT NULL。\\\\n4) 本查询无 GROUP BY，因此不适用 HAVING；如需“只看内容数 N 条以上的栏目”，改用聚合写法：\\\\n   SELECT lcc.ID, lcc.CHANNEL_NAME, COUNT(lcc2.ID) AS 内容数\\\\n   FROM lemon_cms.lm_cms_channel lcc\\\\n     LEFT JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_content lcc2\\\\n            ON lcc2.CHANNEL_ID = lcc.ID AND IFNULL(lcc2.DEL_FLAG,0)=0\\\\n   WHERE IFNULL(lcc.DEL_FLAG,0)=0\\\\n   GROUP BY lcc.ID, lcc.CHANNEL_NAME\\\\n   HAVING COUNT(lcc2.ID) > 5;\\\\n5) 顺带修正：原 SQL 中 lcc.SITE_ID 与 lcm.SITE_ID 别名同为“所属站点”、lcs.id 别名“主键”易混淆，已改为“栏目所属站点/模型所属站点/站点主键”。\\\\n\\\\n已用 run_sql 试跑基础版（去掉注释条件）成功，返回 45 行；带示例值的完整条件版语法也验证通过（示例值不匹配故 0 行）。\\\", \\\"warnings\\\": \\n[\\\"注释里的示例值（\'示例站点\'、\'main\'、\'/news%\'、\'01\' 等）是占位符，需替换为真实值；连接未开放样例数据，PROJECT_TYPE 的实际枚举值我无法读取，请先执行 SELECT DISTINCT PROJECT_TYPE FROM lemon_cms.lm_cms_content WHERE IFNULL(DEL_FLAG,0)=0 确认。\\\", \\\"lm_cms_channel.SITE_ID 是 varchar、lm_cms_site.id 是 bigint，JOIN 时存在隐式类型转换；如需在大表上跑，建议显式 CAST 或统一字段类型以避免索引失效。\\\", \\\"内容条件写在 WHERE 会让 LEFT JOIN 失效（不再输出无内容栏目）；请按业务需要决定放在 ON 还是 WHERE。\\\", \\\"ORDER BY 使用了未勾选的 lcc.ORDER_NUM / lcc2.RELEASE_TIME 仅为稳定排序，不需要可删除。\\\", \\\"LIMIT 1000 沿用你原预览设置，导出全量时请自行调整。\\\"]\\n\\n, \\\"replaceSelection\\\": true}\"}]',NULL,NULL,'{\"proposedSql\":{\"sql\":\"SELECT\\n  -- ========== 站点 lm_cms_site ==========\\n  lcs.site_name                AS 站点名称,\\n  lcs.id                       AS 站点主键,\\n  lcs.site_key                 AS 站点标识,\\n  lcs.site_path                AS 站点资源路径,\\n  -- ========== 栏目 lm_cms_channel ==========\\n  lcc.CHANNEL_NAME             AS 栏目名称,\\n  lcc.CHANNEL_PATH             AS 栏目路径,\\n  lcc.SITE_ID                  AS 栏目所属站点,\\n  lcc.MODEL_ID                 AS 栏目模型,\\n  -- ========== 模型 lm_cms_model ==========\\n  lcm.MODEL_NAME               AS 模型名称,\\n  lcm.MODEL_PATH               AS 模型路径,\\n  lcm.SITE_ID                  AS 模型所属站点,\\n  -- ========== 内容 lm_cms_content ==========\\n  lcc2.CHANNEL_ID              AS 所属栏目,\\n  lcc2.TITLE                   AS 标题,\\n  lcc2.PROJECT_CODE            AS 项目编号,\\n  lcc2.PROJECT_TYPE            AS 项目类型\\nFROM lemon_cms.lm_cms_channel lcc\\n  INNER JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_model lcm\\n          ON lcm.ID = lcc.MODEL_ID\\n         AND IFNULL(lcm.DEL_FLAG, 0) = 0          -- 模型软删除（库中存在 DEL_FLAG=2 的记录）\\n  INNER JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_site lcs\\n          ON lcs.id = lcc.SITE_ID\\n         AND IFNULL(lcs.del_flag, 0) = 0          -- 站点软删除\\n  LEFT JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_content lcc2\\n          ON lcc2.CHANNEL_ID = lcc.ID\\n         AND IFNULL(lcc2.DEL_FLAG, 0) = 0         -- 内容软删除\\nWHERE IFNULL(lcc.DEL_FLAG, 0) = 0                 -- 栏目软删除\\n  -- ========== 以下为按需勾选的筛选条件（取消注释并替换示例值） ==========\\n  -- 【站点】\\n  -- AND lcs.site_name LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'示例站点\', \'%\')\\n  -- AND lcs.id = 1\\n  -- AND lcs.site_key = \'main\'\\n  -- AND lcs.site_path LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'/upload\', \'%\')\\n  -- 【栏目】\\n  -- AND lcc.CHANNEL_NAME LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'新闻\', \'%\')\\n  -- AND lcc.CHANNEL_PATH LIKE \'/news%\'\\n  -- AND lcc.SITE_ID IN (\'1\', \'2\')\\n  -- AND lcc.MODEL_ID IN (1, 2)\\n  -- 【模型】\\n  -- AND lcm.MODEL_NAME LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'文章\', \'%\')\\n  -- AND lcm.MODEL_PATH LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'article\', \'%\')\\n  -- AND lcm.SITE_ID = lcc.SITE_ID                -- 只保留模型与栏目同站点的组合\\n  -- 【内容】写在 WHERE 中 => 只返回“有匹配内容”的栏目行\\n  -- AND lcc2.TITLE LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'公告\', \'%\')\\n  -- AND lcc2.PROJECT_CODE LIKE CONCAT(\'%\', \'XM2024\', \'%\')\\n  -- AND lcc2.PROJECT_TYPE IN (\'01\', \'02\')\\n  -- AND lcc2.CHANNEL_ID = 10\\n  -- 【内容】若希望保留无内容的栏目，把上面几条内容条件移到 LEFT JOIN 的 ON 里，\\n  --        或用这一行替代： AND (lcc2.ID IS NULL OR lcc2.PROJECT_TYPE IN (\'01\',\'02\'))\\nORDER BY lcs.id, lcc.ORDER_NUM, lcc2.RELEASE_TIME DESC\\nLIMIT 1000\",\"explanation\":\"思路：以栏目 lm_cms_channel 为主表，按关系画布中配置的权威关联补齐模型、站点、内容三表——lm_cms_channel.MODEL_ID = lm_cms_model.ID（INNER）、lm_cms_channel.SITE_ID = lm_cms_site.id（INNER）、lm_cms_content.CHANNEL_ID = lm_cms_channel.ID（LEFT，保留空栏目）。\\n\\n筛选条件设计：\\n1) 必备条件（已启用）：四张表的软删除标记统一按 IFNULL(DEL_FLAG/del_flag,0)=0 排除。实测 lm_cms_model 存在 DEL_FLAG=2 的历史数据，其余三表当前无已删数据，但保留条件更稳妥。\\n2) 可选条件（注释形式给出，覆盖你勾选的全部 15 个字段）：文本类字段用 LIKE CONCAT(\'%\',?,\'%\') 便于模糊搜索；主键/外键类（lcs.id、lcc.SITE_ID、lcc.MODEL_ID、lcc2.CHANNEL_ID）用 = 或 IN；枚举类 PROJECT_TYPE 用 IN。\\n3) 内容表条件的位置决定语义：放 WHERE → 结果只包含“有匹配内容”的栏目（LEFT JOIN 退化为 INNER）；放 ON → 仍输出无内容的栏目（标题等列为 NULL）。需要“必须能匹配到内容”时可加 AND lcc2.ID IS NOT NULL。\\n4) 本查询无 GROUP BY，因此不适用 HAVING；如需“只看内容数 N 条以上的栏目”，改用聚合写法：\\n   SELECT lcc.ID, lcc.CHANNEL_NAME, COUNT(lcc2.ID) AS 内容数\\n   FROM lemon_cms.lm_cms_channel lcc\\n     LEFT JOIN lemon_cms.lm_cms_content lcc2\\n            ON lcc2.CHANNEL_ID = lcc.ID AND IFNULL(lcc2.DEL_FLAG,0)=0\\n   WHERE IFNULL(lcc.DEL_FLAG,0)=0\\n   GROUP BY lcc.ID, lcc.CHANNEL_NAME\\n   HAVING COUNT(lcc2.ID) > 5;\\n5) 顺带修正：原 SQL 中 lcc.SITE_ID 与 lcm.SITE_ID 别名同为“所属站点”、lcs.id 别名“主键”易混淆，已改为“栏目所属站点/模型所属站点/站点主键”。\\n\\n已用 run_sql 试跑基础版（去掉注释条件）成功，返回 45 行；带示例值的完整条件版语法也验证通过（示例值不匹配故 0 行）。\",\"warnings\":[\"注释里的示例值（\'示例站点\'、\'main\'、\'/news%\'、\'01\' 等）是占位符，需替换为真实值；连接未开放样例数据，PROJECT_TYPE 的实际枚举值我无法读取，请先执行 SELECT DISTINCT PROJECT_TYPE FROM lemon_cms.lm_cms_content WHERE IFNULL(DEL_FLAG,0)=0 确认。\",\"lm_cms_channel.SITE_ID 是 varchar、lm_cms_site.id 是 bigint，JOIN 时存在隐式类型转换；如需在大表上跑，建议显式 CAST 或统一字段类型以避免索引失效。\",\"内容条件写在 WHERE 会让 LEFT JOIN 失效（不再输出无内容栏目）；请按业务需要决定放在 ON 还是 WHERE。\",\"ORDER BY 使用了未勾选的 lcc.ORDER_NUM / lcc2.RELEASE_TIME 仅为稳定排序，不需要可删除。\",\"LIMIT 1000 沿用你原预览设置，导出全量时请自行调整。\"],\"writeOperation\":false,\"replaceSelection\":true}}',9788,2044,1467891621250176,'2026-09-06 21:01:45'),
