(1470528910509184,1470528714015872,2,'assistant',NULL,'The user has an H2 database. They tried to create an alias for \"java.lang.Math.max\" which is overloaded — H2 requires a unique method match by parameter count. Error: Matching Java methods must have different parameter counts.\n\nFix: alias a non-overloaded method, or use a specific signature. H2\'s CREATE ALIAS resolves by name; overloads with same param count cause this error. Options:\n1. Use a method with unique name/param count, e.g. java.lang.Math.max has max(int,int), max(long,long), max(float,float), max(double,double) — all 2 params → conflict.\n2. Create a wrapper Java class and alias it — but requires class on classpath.\n3. Use H2\'s built-in MAX with two args? H2 has a scalar function `MAX(a, b)`? Actually H2 supports `MAX` as aggregate; for two-arg there\'s `GREATEST` in newer versions. H2 2.x supports GREATEST. H2 version here: [90073-200] → build 200 means H2 1.4.200. Does 1.4.200 support GREATEST? H2 1.4.200 does not have GREATEST (added in 2.0? Actually H2 has `GREATEST` since 1.4.200? Let me think. H2 docs list GREATEST as a function; in 1.4.200 there\'s `MAX(p1, p2)` documented as \"the larger of two values\" — yes! In H2 1.4.200, `MAX` with multiple parameters is supported as scalar. Hmm, in 1.4.200 docs: MAX(...): \"Returns the largest value from a list of expressions.\" and there\'s a separate aggregate MAX. Also GREATEST exists in H2 2.x.\n\nAnyway the user wants to fix the CREATE ALIAS. Solutions:\n- Alias a non-overloaded method, e.g. `java.lang.Math.abs`? abs is overloaded too (int/long/float/double) — same param count → same error.\n- Choose a method with a unique name, e.g. `java.lang.Math.hypot(double,double)` — unique name, 2 params, no overloads. Or `java.lang.Math.maxEx`? Not exist.\n- Or `java.lang.Integer.max(int,int)` — only one overload! Integer.max has only (int,int). Similarly Long.max. So `CREATE ALIAS \"new_function\" FOR \"java.lang.Integer.max\"` works.\n- Or `java.lang.Math.floorDiv`? overloaded (int,int) and (long,long) — same count → conflict.\n- `java.lang.String.valueOf` many overloads with 1 param → conflict.\n- `java.lang.Math.sqrt(double)` unique — 1 param.\n\nAlso note H2 1.4.200 requires CREATE ALIAS to be run via DDL channel; and the client says \"执行DDL失败\" — so it went to DDL channel, just needs the right method. Also H2 aliases by default are Java source? No — FOR \"fully.qualified.Class.method\". Also could use AS with Java source code in H2 1.4.200: `CREATE ALIAS parseDoubleForSearch AS \'double parseDoubleForSearch(String in){...}\'` — H2 supports defining alias with Java source in a string! Yes: H2 1.4.200 supports `CREATE ALIAS name AS { java source }` — actually the syntax is:\n\nCREATE ALIAS parseDoubleForSearch AS \'double parseDoubleForSearch(String in) { return (in==null?0:Double.parseDouble(in)); }\';\n\nThat\'s supported in H2 (compiles with in-memory javac if JDK present; H2 ships with a built-in compiler? In 1.4.200 it requires JDK/tools.jar or uses its own). It works when a JDK is available.\n\nBetter: also mention adding a DISTINCT/param? H2 has no way to disambiguate overloads except by param count. Actually H2 does support specifying parameter types? Let me recall H2 docs: \"If multiple methods with the same name and same number of parameters exist, an exception is thrown.\" There\'s no way to disambiguate. So use a unique method or a wrapper.\n\nLet me verify by running a test? We can\'t run DDL via run_sql. But we can verify the alternative exists? We can\'t test CREATE ALIAS. We could verify H2 version via run_sql \"SELECT H2VERSION()\". And check whether GREATEST/MAX two-arg works: SELECT MAX(3,5) — but that\'s an aggregate... Actually SELECT MAX(3,5) may fail. Let\'s test H2VERSION and maybe `SELECT GREATEST(1.5, 2.5)`.\n\nLet me run a couple of validation queries in parallel.\n\nPlan: propose_sql with fixed DDL using java.lang.Integer.max (or Double via wrapper source), replaceSelection true, warnings: DDL channel needs 改结构 permission; overloaded method disambiguation.\n\nLet me check version first.\n','[{\"id\":\"call_82f983c4648d44ccb84569f9\",\"name\":\"run_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT H2VERSION() AS h2_version\\\", \\\"purpose\\\": \\\"确认 H2 版本，判断可用的函数与别名语法\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"call_5d0dd7669cf4419b80c8fdde\",\"name\":\"run_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT MAX(3, 7) AS two_arg_max, GREATEST(2.5, 8.1) AS greatest_val\\\", \\\"purpose\\\": \\\"验证是否已有内置两参数取最大值函数（可替代自建别名）\\\"}\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,3825,1265,1467891621250176,'2026-09-09 15:18:44'),
