nt blocked it. The error text given by the user is \"执行失败: 执行查询失败: Function new_function not found\" — \"执行查询失败\" means it went through the read-only query channel, so the failing statement is a SELECT calling the function, not the DDL. So most likely: the DDL never ran (or ran as quoted lowercase), and the user called it unquoted lowercase.\n\nBest fix: create alias with unquoted name (folds to NEW_FUNCTION) and call unquoted. Let me verify H2 behavior by testing a select with a known builtin function case folding, e.g. SELECT greatest(...) works. Let me check whether H2 here has schema listing and test creating... I can\'t create (run_sql is read-only).\n\nLet me check INFORMATION_SCHEMA.SCHEMATA / TABLES to figure out version and whether aliases exist under different name. Try ROUTINES too.','[{\"id\":\"call_30d4a5a223b54bc5beebde33\",\"name\":\"run_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT ROUTINE_CATALOG, ROUTINE_SCHEMA, ROUTINE_NAME, ROUTINE_TYPE, DATA_TYPE FROM INFORMATION_SCHEMA.ROUTINES\\\", \\\"purpose\\\": \\\"H2 2.x 中别名归入 ROUTINES，确认 new_function 是否已存在及其真实大小写\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"call_74c4519b576944e584ed2ba6\",\"name\":\"run_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT NEW_FUNCTION(3, 7) AS upper_form\\\", \\\"purpose\\\": \\\"验证不带引号（折叠为大写 NEW_FUNCTION）时能否解析到函数\\\"}\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,5339,856,1467891621250176,'2026-09-09 15:22:02'),
