(1470531201352832,1470528714015872,24,'assistant','已定位：报错不是 SQL 写法问题，而是**函数名解析不上**。我在当前实例里查到别名确实存在（`INFORMATION_SCHEMA.FUNCTION_ALIASES` 有 1 行，`ALIAS_NAME` 为 12 字符，即带引号存成小写 `new_function`），并且下面三种调用都验证通过：\n\n- `SELECT \"new_function\"(3, 7)` ✅\n- `SELECT NEW_FUNCTION(3, 7)` ✅（不带引号会折叠成大写，H2 1.4.200 仍按不区分大小写匹配到了它）\n- `SELECT PUBLIC.NEW_FUNCTION(3, 7)` ✅\n\n所以你这次 `Function \"NEW_FUNCTION\" not found` 只可能是**执行 SELECT 的那个会话里根本没有这个别名**——最常见两种原因：\n1. H2 是内存库（`jdbc:h2:mem:...`），`CREATE ALIAS` 和 `SELECT` 不在同一个连接/同一个库上（比如换了 tab、连接重连过、或库名不同），别名不会跨库存在；\n2. 之前那条 `CREATE ALIAS` 实际没执行成功（上一轮它报的是 90073 建函数失败），你先跑了调用。\n\n修复建议：把别名定义为**不带引号**的名字（统一折叠为大写），调用时也不带引号，彻底避开大小写歧义；并确保两条语句在**同一个连接**上、先 DDL 后 SELECT。\n\n```sql\n-- 第 1 步（改结构通道）\nCREATE ALIAS IF NOT EXISTS NEW_FUNCTION FOR \"java.lang.Integer.max\"\n-- 第 2 步（查询通道）\nSELECT NEW_FUNCTION(3, 7);\n```\n\n若只是取两值较大者，本实例内置 `GREATEST` 已验证可用（`SELECT GREATEST(3,7)`、`SELECT GREATEST(2.5,8.1)` 均成功），**无需任何 DDL 权限**，推荐直接用它。\n\n','The alias exists (alias_name is 12 chars = \"new_function\" is 12 characters, so it\'s stored as lowercase quoted name \"new_function\"). Both NEW_FUNCTION(3,7) and \"new_function\"(3,7) work in my verification, and PUBLIC.NEW_FUNCTION works too. So the user\'s \"Function new_function not found\" is likely from a stale session (executed in a different connection/session where the alias wasn\'t created — aliases are per-database, but if the user\'s editor session is a different in-memory DB, or the DDL wasn\'t actually run / ran on another connection), or they ran the call before the CREATE ALIAS succeeded.\n\nKey insight: alias exists now in this instance and calls work. So the fix: ensure the CREATE ALIAS is executed in the same connection/session as the query (in-memory H2 DB name must match, e.g. jdbc:h2:mem:test), and use the correct name. Also recommend a robust form: create alias without quotes so name folds to uppercase NEW_FUNCTION, and call it unquoted — avoids case mismatch entirely.\n\nI should give a fix: DROP the lowercase quoted alias and re-create with unquoted name, or simply call with the right case. Since the user asked to fix SQL per the error, and current selection is presumably the SELECT \"new_function\"(3,7) or the CREATE ALIAS. Their selected SQL earlier was the CREATE ALIAS. The error is about the function call.\n\nBest final answer: single statement. Which one to propose? The user says \"请根据报错修复 SQL\" — the error is Function new_function not found. The fix is to make name resolution consistent: create alias with an unquoted identifier (stored uppercase) and call it unquoted. But the alias already exists as lowercase and both quoted/unquoted calls work in my session... meaning the user\'s failing session differs (different DB / different connection, or the alias was created in another tab\'s in-memory DB).\n\nI\'ll propose the DDL (CREATE ALIAS with unquoted name) as the fix, plus explanation that the SELECT must run in the same connection & after the DDL succeeded, and offer the built-in GREATEST as zero-DDL alternative.\n\nSince two statements can\'t be run at once, I\'ll propose the CREATE ALIAS (IF NOT EXISTS, unquoted name) as replaceSelection true, and include the call SQL in explanation.\n\nActually maybe better: propose the SELECT using GREATEST? But the user\'s intent is to create the function. I\'ll go with the DDL fix and clearly document.\n\nWarnings: aliases are per-connection/per-database (in-memory), need 改结构 permission, single statement, name case.\n\nLet me write it.','[{\"id\":\"call_50d6ebe3de21486e91b0905f\",\"name\":\"propose_sql\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"sql\\\": \\\"CREATE ALIAS IF NOT EXISTS NEW_FUNCTION FOR \\\\\\\"java.lang.Integer.max\\\\\\\"\\\", \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"修复「Function new_function not found」：改用不带双引号的别名名，H2 会统一折叠为大写 NEW_FUNCTION，调用时同样不带引号（SELECT NEW_FUNCTION(3, 7)），从根本上消除大小写不匹配。\\\\n\\\\n验证情况（当前实例，H2 1.4.200）：\\\\n- INFORMATION_SCHEMA.FUNCTION_ALIASES 中已存在 1 个别名，名为带引号的小写 new_function，指向 java.lang.Integer 的 max 方法；\\\\n- SELECT \\\\\\\"new_function\\\\\\\"(3,7)、SELECT NEW_FUNCTION(3,7)、SELECT PUBLIC.NEW_FUNCTION(3,7) 三条均执行成功。\\\\n说明函数本身没问题，你的报错来自「执行 SELECT 的会话没有该别名」：H2 别名只存在于单个数据库内，内存库（jdbc:h2:mem:xxx）在换连接/重连/不同库名时会丢失。请确认 CREATE ALIAS 与 SELECT 跑在同一个连接上，且先执行 DDL 再执行查询（一次只能提交一条语句）。\\\\n\\\\n执行顺序：\\\\n1) CREATE ALIAS IF NOT EXISTS NEW_FUNCTION FOR \\\\\\\"java.lang.Integer.max\\\\\\\"   —— 走「改结构」通道\\\\n2) SELECT NEW_FUNCTION(3, 7);                                          —— 走只读查询通道\\\\n\\\\n如需小数精度，把目标换成 \\\\\\\"java.lang.Double.max\\\\\\\"（该类也只有一个 max 重载，不会再触发 90073 重载歧义）。\\\\n\\\\n零 DDL 替代方案（已验证）：SELECT GREATEST(3, 7);  /  SELECT GREATEST(2.5, 8.1);\\\", \\\"warnings\\\": \\n[\\\"DDL（CREATE ALIAS）需人工确认，走「改结构」通道；无权限时会报“无权修改表结构”，那不是语法错误\\\", \\\"不支持多语句：请一次只执行一条，先 CREATE ALIAS 再 SELECT\\\", \\\"别名不跨数据库存在：内存库重连或换了连接/库名后需重新创建，否则调用必然 Function not found\\\", \\\"原别名以带引号小写 new_function 存储，若沿用旧名调用需写成 SELECT \\\\\\\"new_function\\\\\\\"(3, 7)；本方案改用不带引号的 NEW_FUNCTION 以免歧义\\\", \\\"java.lang.Integer.max 参数为 int，传小数会隐式转换或报错，需小数请用 java.lang.Double.max\\\", \\\"若目标只是取两值最大，建议直接用内置 GREATEST(a, b)，无需建函数与改结构权限\\\"]\\n\\n, \\\"replaceSelection\\\": true}\"}]',NULL,NULL,'{\"proposedSql\":{\"sql\":\"CREATE ALIAS IF NOT EXISTS NEW_FUNCTION FOR \\\"java.lang.Integer.max\\\"\",\"explanation\":\"修复「Function new_function not found」：改用不带双引号的别名名，H2 会统一折叠为大写 NEW_FUNCTION，调用时同样不带引号（SELECT NEW_FUNCTION(3, 7)），从根本上消除大小写不匹配。\\n\\n验证情况（当前实例，H2 1.4.200）：\\n- INFORMATION_SCHEMA.FUNCTION_ALIASES 中已存在 1 个别名，名为带引号的小写 new_function，指向 java.lang.Integer 的 max 方法；\\n- SELECT \\\"new_function\\\"(3,7)、SELECT NEW_FUNCTION(3,7)、SELECT PUBLIC.NEW_FUNCTION(3,7) 三条均执行成功。\\n说明函数本身没问题，你的报错来自「执行 SELECT 的会话没有该别名」：H2 别名只存在于单个数据库内，内存库（jdbc:h2:mem:xxx）在换连接/重连/不同库名时会丢失。请确认 CREATE ALIAS 与 SELECT 跑在同一个连接上，且先执行 DDL 再执行查询（一次只能提交一条语句）。\\n\\n执行顺序：\\n1) CREATE ALIAS IF NOT EXISTS NEW_FUNCTION FOR \\\"java.lang.Integer.max\\\"   —— 走「改结构」通道\\n2) SELECT NEW_FUNCTION(3, 7);                                          —— 走只读查询通道\\n\\n如需小数精度，把目标换成 \\\"java.lang.Double.max\\\"（该类也只有一个 max 重载，不会再触发 90073 重载歧义）。\\n\\n零 DDL 替代方案（已验证）：SELECT GREATEST(3, 7);  /  SELECT GREATEST(2.5, 8.1);\",\"warnings\":[\"DDL（CREATE ALIAS）需人工确认，走「改结构」通道；无权限时会报“无权修改表结构”，那不是语法错误\",\"不支持多语句：请一次只执行一条，先 CREATE ALIAS 再 SELECT\",\"别名不跨数据库存在：内存库重连或换了连接/库名后需重新创建，否则调用必然 Function not found\",\"原别名以带引号小写 new_function 存储，若沿用旧名调用需写成 SELECT \\\"new_function\\\"(3, 7)；本方案改用不带引号的 NEW_FUNCTION 以免歧义\",\"java.lang.Integer.max 参数为 int，传小数会隐式转换或报错，需小数请用 java.lang.Double.max\",\"若目标只是取两值最大，建议直接用内置 GREATEST(a, b)，无需建函数与改结构权限\",\"这是写操作或无法通过只读校验（仅允许执行 SELECT / SHOW / DESCRIBE / EXPLAIN / PRAGMA 类只读语句），请人工确认后执行\"],\"writeOperation\":true,\"replaceSelection\":true}}',6391,1632,1467891621250176,'2026-09-09 15:23:23'),
