(1468271623849088,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_acq_data','lm_acq_data','存储采集数据原始内容。','**lm_acq_data** — 存储采集数据原始内容。\n\n保存单条采集数据文本及创建时间。可能由采集接口或导入任务写入。常见查询按时间或数据内容检索。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `id` (pk) 主键\n- `data` (other) 采集数据内容\n- `create_time` (time) 创建时间\n\n### 关联\n\n### 注意事项\n- 字段注释缺失，具体采集业务未知\n- data为varchar(3000)，可能截断\n- 无删除标识，查询通常需限定create_time\n','[{\"field\":\"id\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"data\",\"meaning\":\"采集数据内容\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"create_time\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[]','cd0721ade7119d21d862f6c747262412','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:16','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:03'),
(1468271630009472,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_api_call_log','lm_api_call_log','记录会员API调用及额度扣减结果。','**lm_api_call_log** — 记录会员API调用及额度扣减结果。\n\n保存每次API调用的请求、响应、状态、IP、UA和扣减次数。由API接口或网关写入。用于审计、失败排查和调用量统计。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `MEMBER_USER_ID` (fk) 会员用户ID\n- `API_NAME` (other) API名称\n- `API_PATH` (other) API路径\n- `DEDUCT_QUOTA` (amount) 扣减额度次数\n- `CALL_TIME` (time) 调用时间\n- `CALL_STATUS` (status) 调用状态：1-成功 2-失败\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_api_call_log.MEMBER_USER_ID = lm_api_quota.MEMBER_USER_ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- CALL_STATUS枚举：1成功、2失败\n- DEDUCT_QUOTA默认1次\n- REQUEST_PARAMS和RESPONSE_DATA可能含敏感信息\n- 无DEL_FLAG字段，不存在软删除过滤\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"MEMBER_USER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"会员用户ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"API_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"API名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"API_PATH\",\"meaning\":\"API路径\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DEDUCT_QUOTA\",\"meaning\":\"扣减额度次数\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"CALL_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"调用时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"CALL_STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"调用状态：1-成功 2-失败\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_api_quota\",\"onSql\":\"lm_api_call_log.MEMBER_USER_ID = lm_api_quota.MEMBER_USER_ID\",\"type\":\"N:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.6,\"meaning\":\"按会员用户关联调用记录与额度记录\"}]','3be9be1f247b8e8e1c96c3c2689b69b3','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:17','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:03'),
(1468271636366464,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_api_quota','lm_api_quota','管理会员API调用额度与对话额度。','**lm_api_quota** — 管理会员API调用额度与对话额度。\n\n保存会员购买、赠送或活动获得的调用额度、使用量和过期状态。由订单购买、赠送活动或后台调整写入。用于鉴权扣减和额度展示。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `MEMBER_USER_ID` (fk) 会员用户ID\n- `ORDER_NO` (other) 购买关联订单号\n- `QUOTA_TYPE` (status) 额度类型：1-购买获得 2-赠送 3-活动\n- `TOTAL_QUOTA` (amount) 总额度\n- `USED_QUOTA` (amount) 已使用额度\n- `REMAIN_QUOTA` (amount) 剩余额度\n- `EXPIRE_TIME` (time) 过期时间，NULL表示永久有效\n- `STATUS` (status) 状态：1-可用 2-已用完 3-已过期\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识：0-未删除 1-已删除\n- `STOP_COUNT` (amount) 中止返还次数\n- `USED_REFUND_COUNT` (amount) 已使用的返还次数\n- `TOTAL_CHAT_QUOTA` (amount) 总对话额度\n- `USED_CHAT_QUOTA` (amount) 已使用对话额度\n- `REMAIN_CHAT_QUOTA` (amount) 剩余对话额度\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_api_call_log.MEMBER_USER_ID = lm_api_quota.MEMBER_USER_ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- 查询可用额度通常需过滤DEL_FLAG=0且STATUS=1\n- EXPIRE_TIME为NULL表示永久有效\n- STOP_COUNT和USED_REFUND_COUNT为返还次数池，消耗顺序需按业务确认\n- 对话额度单位为总量，不是次数\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"MEMBER_USER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"会员用户ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"ORDER_NO\",\"meaning\":\"购买关联订单号\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"QUOTA_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"额度类型：1-购买获得 2-赠送 3-活动\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"TOTAL_QUOTA\",\"meaning\":\"总额度\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"USED_QUOTA\",\"meaning\":\"已使用额度\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"REMAIN_QUOTA\",\"meaning\":\"剩余额度\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"EXPIRE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"过期时间，NULL表示永久有效\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"状态：1-可用 2-已用完 3-已过期\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识：0-未删除 1-已删除\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"STOP_COUNT\",\"meaning\":\"中止返还次数\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"USED_REFUND_COUNT\",\"meaning\":\"已使用的返还次数\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"TOTAL_CHAT_QUOTA\",\"meaning\":\"总对话额度\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"USED_CHAT_QUOTA\",\"meaning\":\"已使用对话额度\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"REMAIN_CHAT_QUOTA\",\"meaning\":\"剩余对话额度\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_api_call_log\",\"onSql\":\"lm_api_call_log.MEMBER_USER_ID = lm_api_quota.MEMBER_USER_ID\",\"type\":\"N:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.6,\"meaning\":\"按会员用户关联额度记录与调用记录\"}]','0acec4c7f312f35bfaadc11adcbabdbb','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:17','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:03'),
(1468271643231360,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_attachment','lm_attachment','存储通用附件文件元数据。','**lm_attachment** — 存储通用附件文件元数据。\n\n保存附件名称、类型、路径、下载URL、大小和上传人。由文件上传服务写入。常见按业务ID和模块编码查询附件。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `CONFIG_ID` (other) 附件配置ID\n- `MODULE_CODE` (other) 业务模块编码\n- `BELONG_ID` (fk) 业务ID\n- `ATTACH_TYPE` (other) 附件类型\n- `SAVE_PATH` (other) 保存路径\n- `FULL_SAVE_PATH` (other) 磁盘路径\n- `DOWNLOAD_URL` (other) 下载路径\n- `USER_ID` (fk) 上传用户ID\n- `FILE_SIZE` (amount) 文件长度\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_biofeedback.ATTACHMENT_ID = lm_attachment.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- ID为varchar(50)，与其他表varchar附件ID关联\n- BELONG_ID是通用业务ID，需结合MODULE_CODE判断业务表\n- DEL_FLAG注释未给出枚举，通常按0未删除、1已删除理解\n- FULL_SAVE_PATH可能依赖服务器环境\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"CONFIG_ID\",\"meaning\":\"附件配置ID\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"MODULE_CODE\",\"meaning\":\"业务模块编码\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"BELONG_ID\",\"meaning\":\"业务ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"ATTACH_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"附件类型\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"SAVE_PATH\",\"meaning\":\"保存路径\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"FULL_SAVE_PATH\",\"meaning\":\"磁盘路径\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DOWNLOAD_URL\",\"meaning\":\"下载路径\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"USER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"上传用户ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"FILE_SIZE\",\"meaning\":\"文件长度\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_biofeedback\",\"onSql\":\"lm_biofeedback.ATTACHMENT_ID = lm_attachment.ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.75,\"meaning\":\"附件可被生物反馈记录引用\"}]','448326d2c40fc7aaa31f83d2e3f11f7f','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:18','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:03'),
(1468271650415744,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_bazi_person','lm_bazi_person','存储用户维护的八字人员档案。','**lm_bazi_person** — 存储用户维护的八字人员档案。\n\n保存姓名、性别、公历和阴历出生时间、分组及默认标记。由用户或后台创建。用于八字测算时选择人员。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `USER_ID` (fk) 创建用户ID\n- `NAME` (other) 姓名\n- `GENDER` (other) 性别\n- `BIRTH_DATE_TIME` (time) 出生公历日期时间\n- `YIN_LI_BIRTH_DATE_TIME` (other) 出生阴历日期时间\n- `GROUP_NAME` (other) 分组\n- `IS_DEFAULT` (status) 是否为默认八字\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n\n### 注意事项\n- IS_DEFAULT为int(1)，1表示默认，0含义未知\n- YIN_LI_BIRTH_DATE_TIME为varchar，格式可能不统一\n- 无DEL_FLAG字段，查询需注意业务过滤\n- USER_ID可能关联用户表，但用户表未在输入中提供\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"USER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"创建用户ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"NAME\",\"meaning\":\"姓名\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"GENDER\",\"meaning\":\"性别\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"BIRTH_DATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"出生公历日期时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"YIN_LI_BIRTH_DATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"出生阴历日期时间\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"GROUP_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"分组\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"IS_DEFAULT\",\"meaning\":\"是否为默认八字\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[]','b049474476d0e6bcbf5766f714b62ce1','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:19','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:03'),
(1468271656379520,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_biofeedback','lm_biofeedback','存储生物反馈文件及解析状态。','**lm_biofeedback** — 存储生物反馈文件及解析状态。\n\n保存上传的生物反馈文件路径、解密路径、处理状态和原始多行文本。由采集或上传流程写入。用于文件处理状态跟踪和结果查看。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `ATTACHMENT_ID` (fk) 附件ID\n- `URL` (other) 文件路径\n- `DECRY_URL` (other) 解密文件路径\n- `DATA_STATUS` (status) 文件处理状态\n- `TXT` (other) 多行文本\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_biofeedback.ATTACHMENT_ID = lm_attachment.ID [ai]\n- lm_biofeedback_details.BIOFEEDBACK_ID = lm_biofeedback.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- DATA_STATUS为varchar(1)，枚举未知\n- DEL_FLAG通常按0未删除、1已删除理解\n- ATTACHMENT_ID为varchar(50)，与lm_attachment.ID类型一致\n- TXT为longtext，列表查询避免全量读取\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"ATTACHMENT_ID\",\"meaning\":\"附件ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"URL\",\"meaning\":\"文件路径\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DECRY_URL\",\"meaning\":\"解密文件路径\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DATA_STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"文件处理状态\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"TXT\",\"meaning\":\"多行文本\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_attachment\",\"onSql\":\"lm_biofeedback.ATTACHMENT_ID = lm_attachment.ID\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.8,\"meaning\":\"生物反馈记录引用附件\"},{\"table\":\"lm_biofeedback_details\",\"onSql\":\"lm_biofeedback_details.BIOFEEDBACK_ID = lm_biofeedback.ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.85,\"meaning\":\"生物反馈主表包含多条明细\"}]','94855e39b600523351521a1d23d8f1e0','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:20','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:04'),
(1468271663408256,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_biofeedback_details','lm_biofeedback_details','存储生物反馈明细数据点。','**lm_biofeedback_details** — 存储生物反馈明细数据点。\n\n保存设备上传的RRI、心率、步数等明细及时间戳。由设备数据解析入库写入。用于绘制曲线和统计生理指标。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `BIOFEEDBACK_ID` (fk) 生物反馈主表ID\n- `DEVICE_ID` (other) 设备ID\n- `MAC` (other) 设备码\n- `TIME_STAMP` (time) 数据时间戳\n- `SOURCE_RRI` (other) RRI源数据\n- `RRI` (other) 解析RRI\n- `DATA_TYPE` (status) 上传数据类型：1-rri数据 2-心率数据 3-步数\n- `HR_VALUE` (amount) 数值字段，注释为步数\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_biofeedback_details.BIOFEEDBACK_ID = lm_biofeedback.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- DEL_FLAG通常按0未删除、1已删除理解\n- DATA_TYPE枚举：1-rri数据、2-心率数据、3-步数\n- HR_VALUE字段名易混淆，需结合DATA_TYPE判断含义\n- SOURCE_RRI和RRI为长文本，明细数据量可能较大\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"BIOFEEDBACK_ID\",\"meaning\":\"生物反馈主表ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"DEVICE_ID\",\"meaning\":\"设备ID\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"MAC\",\"meaning\":\"设备码\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"TIME_STAMP\",\"meaning\":\"数据时间戳\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"SOURCE_RRI\",\"meaning\":\"RRI源数据\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"RRI\",\"meaning\":\"解析RRI\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DATA_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"上传数据类型：1-rri数据 2-心率数据 3-步数\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"HR_VALUE\",\"meaning\":\"数值字段，注释为步数\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_biofeedback\",\"onSql\":\"lm_biofeedback_details.BIOFEEDBACK_ID = lm_biofeedback.ID\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.85,\"meaning\":\"明细归属生物反馈主表\"}]','6fc2053acf7136fe6736885fb9649462','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:21','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:04'),
(1468271669314688,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_case_detail','lm_case_detail','存储训练方案包含的范式工具及权重分数。','**lm_case_detail** — 存储训练方案包含的范式工具及权重分数。\n\n保存方案下各范式工具、权重和分数。由方案配置或评分流程写入。用于查询方案组成和计算结果。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `CASE_ID` (fk) 方案ID\n- `TOOL_TYPE` (other) 范式类型\n- `TOOL_ID` (other) 范式工具ID\n- `TOOL_NAME` (other) 范式工具名称\n- `WEIGHT` (amount) 权重\n- `SCORE` (amount) 分数\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_case_detail.CASE_ID = lm_case_manage.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- WEIGHT和SCORE为varchar，聚合计算前需转换\n- DEL_FLAG通常按0未删除、1已删除理解\n- TOOL_TYPE与TOOL_ID组合定位范式工具\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"CASE_ID\",\"meaning\":\"方案ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"TOOL_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"范式类型\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"TOOL_ID\",\"meaning\":\"范式工具ID\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"TOOL_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"范式工具名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"WEIGHT\",\"meaning\":\"权重\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"SCORE\",\"meaning\":\"分数\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_case_manage\",\"onSql\":\"lm_case_detail.CASE_ID = lm_case_manage.ID\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"meaning\":\"方案明细归属训练方案\"}]','a6870415afb1538be8d6a6f97499255c','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:22','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:04'),
(1468271676032128,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_case_manage','lm_case_manage','存储训练方案基本信息。','**lm_case_manage** — 存储训练方案基本信息。\n\n保存训练方案名称、岗位、预计时长、难度和模型编号。由后台配置写入。用于方案列表和详情查询。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `CASE_NAME` (other) 训练方案名称\n- `POST` (other) 岗位\n- `ESTIMATE_TIME` (other) 预计时长\n- `DIFFICULTY` (other) 难度\n- `SUMMARY` (other) 范式概要\n- `CASE_CODE` (other) 模型编号\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_case_detail.CASE_ID = lm_case_manage.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- ESTIMATE_TIME为varchar(50)，单位未知\n- DEL_FLAG通常按0未删除、1已删除理解\n- CASE_CODE可能用于外部模型编号\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"CASE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"训练方案名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"POST\",\"meaning\":\"岗位\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"ESTIMATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"预计时长\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DIFFICULTY\",\"meaning\":\"难度\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"SUMMARY\",\"meaning\":\"范式概要\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CASE_CODE\",\"meaning\":\"模型编号\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_case_detail\",\"onSql\":\"lm_case_detail.CASE_ID = lm_case_manage.ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"meaning\":\"训练方案包含多条方案明细\"}]','618c958dd6bb6102a265f98eab533cdb','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:22','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:04'),
(1468271682438272,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','2','画布-2','lm_cms_channel','lm_cms_channel','存储CMS栏目树及展示配置。','**lm_cms_channel** — 存储CMS栏目树及展示配置。\n\n保存栏目名称、路径、站点、模型、父节点、显示排序。由CMS后台维护。用于栏目导航和内容模型关联。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `SITE_ID` (other) 所属站点\n- `MODEL_ID` (fk) 模型ID\n- `PARENT_ID` (fk) 父节点ID\n- `CHANNEL_NAME` (other) 栏目名称\n- `CHANNEL_PATH` (other) 栏目路径\n- `LINK` (other) 外部链接\n- `DISPLAY` (status) 是否显示\n- `ORDER_NUM` (other) 排序\n- `CHANNEL_TYPE` (status) 栏目分类\n- `TYPE_DATA` (other) 栏目分类值\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_cms_model.ID = lm_cms_channel.MODEL_ID [canvas]\n- lm_cms_channel.PARENT_ID = lm_cms_channel.ID [ai]\n- lm_cms_channel_ext.ID = lm_cms_channel.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- DISPLAY枚举未知\n- DEL_FLAG通常按0未删除、1已删除理解\n- PARENT_ID根节点值未知，可能为NULL或0\n- SITE_ID为varchar(10)，具体站点表未在输入中提供\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"SITE_ID\",\"meaning\":\"所属站点\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"MODEL_ID\",\"meaning\":\"模型ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"PARENT_ID\",\"meaning\":\"父节点ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"CHANNEL_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"栏目名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CHANNEL_PATH\",\"meaning\":\"栏目路径\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"LINK\",\"meaning\":\"外部链接\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DISPLAY\",\"meaning\":\"是否显示\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"ORDER_NUM\",\"meaning\":\"排序\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CHANNEL_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"栏目分类\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"TYPE_DATA\",\"meaning\":\"栏目分类值\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_cms_model\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_model.ID = lm_cms_channel.MODEL_ID\",\"type\":\"ONE_TO_MANY\",\"source\":\"canvas\",\"confidence\":1.0},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_channel\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_channel.PARENT_ID = lm_cms_channel.ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.8,\"meaning\":\"父栏目与子栏目自关联\"},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_channel_ext\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_channel_ext.ID = lm_cms_channel.ID\",\"type\":\"1:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.75,\"meaning\":\"栏目扩展表可能共享栏目ID\"}]','6305899c749972790b5073305e6f3e89','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:23','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:04'),
(1468271688246400,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_cms_channel_ext','lm_cms_channel_ext','存储CMS栏目扩展长文本内容。','**lm_cms_channel_ext** — 存储CMS栏目扩展长文本内容。\n\n保存栏目详情或富文本内容。由CMS栏目编辑写入。用于栏目扩展信息查询。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `CHANNEL_TXT` (other) 栏目内容\n\n### 关联\n- lm_cms_channel_ext.ID = lm_cms_channel.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- 仅两个字段，可能是栏目扩展表\n- CHANNEL_TXT为longtext，避免不必要全量查询\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"CHANNEL_TXT\",\"meaning\":\"栏目内容\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_cms_channel\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_channel_ext.ID = lm_cms_channel.ID\",\"type\":\"1:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.75,\"meaning\":\"扩展表ID可能等于栏目ID\"}]','d8cb237b9bc93298a6f5adf90f488334','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:24','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:04'),
(1468271694447744,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_cms_comment','lm_cms_comment','存储CMS内容评论及审核状态。','**lm_cms_comment** — 存储CMS内容评论及审核状态。\n\n保存用户对内容的评论、点赞、父子评论和审核状态。由用户提交和后台审核写入。用于评论展示和审核。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `CONTENT_ID` (fk) 内容ID\n- `USER_ID` (fk) 用户ID\n- `USER_NAME` (other) 用户名称\n- `USER_IP` (other) 用户IP\n- `COMMENT_CONTENT` (other) 评论内容\n- `PARENT_ID` (fk) 父评论ID\n- `STATUS` (status) 状态：0-待审核 1-已通过 2-已拒绝\n- `LIKE_COUNT` (amount) 点赞数量\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标志：0-存在 1-删除\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_cms_comment.PARENT_ID = lm_cms_comment.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- STATUS枚举：0待审核、1已通过、2已拒绝\n- DEL_FLAG枚举：0存在、1删除\n- 展示评论通常需过滤STATUS=1且DEL_FLAG=0\n- PARENT_ID根评论值未知，可能为NULL或0\n- USER_ID为varchar(50)，与其他表bigint用户ID类型不一致\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"CONTENT_ID\",\"meaning\":\"内容ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"USER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"用户ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"USER_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"用户名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"USER_IP\",\"meaning\":\"用户IP\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"COMMENT_CONTENT\",\"meaning\":\"评论内容\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"PARENT_ID\",\"meaning\":\"父评论ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"状态：0-待审核 1-已通过 2-已拒绝\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"LIKE_COUNT\",\"meaning\":\"点赞数量\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标志：0-存在 1-删除\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_cms_comment\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_comment.PARENT_ID = lm_cms_comment.ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.8,\"meaning\":\"父评论与子评论自关联\"}]','6e6684caba5159c7e5b911ee333e94f8','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:25','yan','2026-09-06 17:31:04'),
(1468271700698240,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','d4a4f94f4','默认画布','lm_cms_content','lm_cms_content','CMS内容主表，存储文章/项目等内容元数据。','**lm_cms_content** — CMS内容主表，存储文章/项目等内容元数据。\n\n存储栏目内容的标题、描述、发布、站点、模型、地区、统计等元数据。常见查询是按栏目、站点、模型、发布时间检索内容列表和详情。内容正文通常需联查 lm_cms_content_txt。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 内容主键\n- `CHANNEL_ID` (fk) 所属栏目ID\n- `SITE_ID` (fk) 所属站点ID\n- `MODEL_ID` (fk) 内容模型ID\n- `CONTENT_TYPE` (status) 内容类型，枚举未知\n- `PROJECT_TYPE` (status) 项目类型，枚举未知\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识\n- `RELEASE_TIME` (time) 发布时间\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n- `LIKE_COUNT` (amount) 点赞数\n- `VIEWS` (amount) 访问量\n- `ORDER_NUM` (other) 排序号\n- `PROJECT_CODE` (other) 项目编号\n- `AREA_NO` (other) 所属地区编码\n- `LINK` (other) 外部链接\n- `CONTENT_IMG` (other) 单图上传地址\n\n### 关联\n- lm_cms_model.ID = lm_cms_content.MODEL_ID [canvas]\n- lm_cms_content.MODEL_ID = lm_cms_model.ID [canvas]\n- lm_cms_content.CHANNEL_ID = lm_cms_channel.ID [ai]\n- lm_cms_content.SITE_ID = lm_cms_site.id [ai]\n- lm_cms_content.ID = lm_cms_content_txt.id [ai]\n- lm_cms_content.ID = lm_es_cms_mapping.content_id [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- DEL_FLAG 为软删除标识，查询有效内容通常需过滤；具体有效值未知。\n- CONTENT_TYPE、PROJECT_TYPE、AREA_NO 的枚举或编码含义未知。\n- LIKE_COUNT 字段类型为 int(1)，但业务含义为点赞数量。\n- 正文内容不在本表，通常需联查 lm_cms_content_txt。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"内容主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"CHANNEL_ID\",\"meaning\":\"所属栏目ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"SITE_ID\",\"meaning\":\"所属站点ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"MODEL_ID\",\"meaning\":\"内容模型ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"CONTENT_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"内容类型，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"PROJECT_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"项目类型，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"RELEASE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"发布时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"LIKE_COUNT\",\"meaning\":\"点赞数\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"VIEWS\",\"meaning\":\"访问量\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"ORDER_NUM\",\"meaning\":\"排序号\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"PROJECT_CODE\",\"meaning\":\"项目编号\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"AREA_NO\",\"meaning\":\"所属地区编码\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"LINK\",\"meaning\":\"外部链接\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CONTENT_IMG\",\"meaning\":\"单图上传地址\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_cms_model\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_model.ID = lm_cms_content.MODEL_ID\",\"type\":\"ONE_TO_MANY\",\"source\":\"canvas\",\"confidence\":1.0},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_model\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_content.MODEL_ID = lm_cms_model.ID\",\"type\":\"ONE_TO_ONE\",\"source\":\"canvas\",\"confidence\":1.0},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_channel\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_content.CHANNEL_ID = lm_cms_channel.ID\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.6,\"meaning\":\"内容所属栏目；栏目表未在输入中给出，按常见主键ID推断\"},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_site\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_content.SITE_ID = lm_cms_site.id\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.8,\"meaning\":\"内容所属站点\"},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_content_txt\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_content.ID = lm_cms_content_txt.id\",\"type\":\"1:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"meaning\":\"内容正文扩展表\"},{\"table\":\"lm_es_cms_mapping\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_content.ID = lm_es_cms_mapping.content_id\",\"type\":\"1:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"meaning\":\"内容ES索引映射\"}]','a9b86372f6f50ffdb092cc88c2b97459','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:25','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:28'),
(1468271706645632,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_cms_content_txt','lm_cms_content_txt','CMS内容正文长文本扩展表。','**lm_cms_content_txt** — CMS内容正文长文本扩展表。\n\n存储内容正文或长文本字段。通常与 lm_cms_content 联查获取文章详情。适合查询单篇内容完整正文。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `id` (pk) 主键，疑似内容ID\n- `txt` (other) 长文本内容\n\n### 关联\n- lm_cms_content_txt.id = lm_cms_content.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- 表内无删除、时间、站点、栏目等字段，过滤条件需依赖主表。\n- id 是否严格等于 lm_cms_content.ID 未知，当前按命名和用途推断。\n','[{\"field\":\"id\",\"meaning\":\"主键，疑似内容ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"txt\",\"meaning\":\"长文本内容\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_cms_content\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_content_txt.id = lm_cms_content.ID\",\"type\":\"1:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"meaning\":\"正文扩展表关联内容主表\"}]','885399dd35ee72a41684c41825d6b508','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:26','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:28'),
(1468271713731712,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_cms_global_config','lm_cms_global_config','系统全局配置表，存储路径、端口和默认地区。','**lm_cms_global_config** — 系统全局配置表，存储路径、端口和默认地区。\n\n存储系统级配置，如项目路径、端口、默认地区编码。通常由管理员维护，应用初始化或渲染时读取。常见查询是取单条全局配置。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `CONTEXT_PATH` (other) 项目路径\n- `SYS_PORT` (other) 端口号\n- `DEFAULT_CODE` (other) 系统所属地区编码\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n\n### 注意事项\n- 可能为单行配置表，但输入未明确。\n- DEFAULT_CODE 的地区编码枚举或字典表未知。\n- 无删除标识，查询通常直接取有效配置。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"CONTEXT_PATH\",\"meaning\":\"项目路径\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"SYS_PORT\",\"meaning\":\"端口号\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DEFAULT_CODE\",\"meaning\":\"系统所属地区编码\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[]','22efd2089e95de8726da64562f01da3f','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:27','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:28'),
(1468271721292928,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','d4a4f94f4','默认画布','lm_cms_model','lm_cms_model','CMS内容模型定义表，描述模型与站点归属。','**lm_cms_model** — CMS内容模型定义表，描述模型与站点归属。\n\n存储内容模型名称、路径、所属站点、排序和全站模型标识。由后台模型管理维护。常见查询是按站点或全站标识获取可用模型。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 模型主键\n- `SITE_ID` (fk) 所属站点ID\n- `GLOBAL_MODEL` (status) 全站模型标识，枚举未知\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识\n- `ORDER_NUM` (other) 排序号\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n- `MODEL_NAME` (other) 模型名称\n- `MODEL_PATH` (other) 模型路径\n\n### 关联\n- lm_cms_model.ID = lm_cms_content.MODEL_ID [canvas]\n- lm_cms_model.ID = lm_cms_channel.MODEL_ID [canvas]\n- lm_cms_content.MODEL_ID = lm_cms_model.ID [canvas]\n- lm_cms_model.ID = lm_cms_model_item.MODEL_ID [ai]\n- lm_cms_model.SITE_ID = lm_cms_site.id [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- DEL_FLAG 为软删除标识，查询有效模型通常需过滤；具体有效值未知。\n- GLOBAL_MODEL 枚举含义未知。\n- SITE_ID 为 varchar，与 lm_cms_site.id 联表时注意类型转换。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"模型主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"SITE_ID\",\"meaning\":\"所属站点ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"GLOBAL_MODEL\",\"meaning\":\"全站模型标识，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"ORDER_NUM\",\"meaning\":\"排序号\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"MODEL_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"模型名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"MODEL_PATH\",\"meaning\":\"模型路径\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_cms_content\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_model.ID = lm_cms_content.MODEL_ID\",\"type\":\"ONE_TO_MANY\",\"source\":\"canvas\",\"confidence\":1.0},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_channel\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_model.ID = lm_cms_channel.MODEL_ID\",\"type\":\"ONE_TO_MANY\",\"source\":\"canvas\",\"confidence\":1.0},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_content\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_content.MODEL_ID = lm_cms_model.ID\",\"type\":\"ONE_TO_ONE\",\"source\":\"canvas\",\"confidence\":1.0},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_model_item\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_model.ID = lm_cms_model_item.MODEL_ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"meaning\":\"模型字段配置\"},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_site\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_model.SITE_ID = lm_cms_site.id\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"meaning\":\"模型所属站点\"}]','66b6f77b3286d30420318ab1dfc3f7ba','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:28','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:28'),
(1468271727748224,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_cms_model_item','lm_cms_model_item','模型字段配置表，定义模型可显示字段。','**lm_cms_model_item** — 模型字段配置表，定义模型可显示字段。\n\n存储模型字段、显示区域、排序、默认值、选项等配置。由后台模型设计维护。常见查询是按模型获取表单字段、列表字段或显示字段。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `MODEL_ID` (fk) 模型主键\n- `DISPLAY` (status) 是否显示，枚举未知\n- `MODEL_TYPE` (status) 模型类型，枚举未知\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n- `FIELD` (other) 字段名\n- `FIELD_NAME` (other) 字段显示名称\n- `POSITION` (other) 显示区域\n- `DEFAULT_VALUE` (other) 默认值\n- `DATA_OPTIONS` (other) 数据选项JSON\n- `ORDER_NUM` (other) 排序号\n\n### 关联\n- lm_cms_model_item.MODEL_ID = lm_cms_model.ID [ai]\n- lm_cms_model_item.FIELD = lm_cms_model_item_base.FIELD [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- DEL_FLAG 为软删除标识，查询有效字段配置通常需过滤；具体有效值未知。\n- DISPLAY、MODEL_TYPE、POSITION 的枚举含义未知。\n- DATA_OPTIONS 为 JSON，解析方式未知。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"MODEL_ID\",\"meaning\":\"模型主键\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"DISPLAY\",\"meaning\":\"是否显示，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"MODEL_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"模型类型，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"FIELD\",\"meaning\":\"字段名\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"FIELD_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"字段显示名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"POSITION\",\"meaning\":\"显示区域\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DEFAULT_VALUE\",\"meaning\":\"默认值\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DATA_OPTIONS\",\"meaning\":\"数据选项JSON\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"ORDER_NUM\",\"meaning\":\"排序号\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_cms_model\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_model_item.MODEL_ID = lm_cms_model.ID\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"meaning\":\"字段配置所属模型\"},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_model_item_base\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_model_item.FIELD = lm_cms_model_item_base.FIELD\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.4,\"meaning\":\"字段名可能引用基础字段定义\"}]','5298db58590ef1496bffc66c8c39008b','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:29','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:29'),
(1468271733957760,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_cms_model_item_base','lm_cms_model_item_base','模型基础字段定义表，存储通用字段配置。','**lm_cms_model_item_base** — 模型基础字段定义表，存储通用字段配置。\n\n存储系统基础字段元数据，可能用于模型字段初始化或公共配置。常见查询是按显示区域、字段类型获取基础字段。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `DISPLAY` (status) 是否显示，枚举未知\n- `MODEL_TYPE` (status) 模型类型，枚举未知\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识\n- `FIELD` (other) 字段名\n- `FIELD_NAME` (other) 字段显示名称\n- `POSITION` (other) 显示区域\n- `DEFAULT_VALUE` (other) 默认值\n- `DATA_OPTIONS` (other) 可选值JSON\n- `ORDER_NUM` (other) 排序号\n\n### 关联\n- lm_cms_model_item_base.FIELD = lm_cms_model_item.FIELD [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- 表内无 MODEL_ID，不能直接关联具体模型。\n- DEL_FLAG 为软删除标识，具体有效值未知。\n- MODEL_TYPE、DISPLAY、POSITION 的枚举含义未知。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"DISPLAY\",\"meaning\":\"是否显示，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"MODEL_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"模型类型，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"FIELD\",\"meaning\":\"字段名\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"FIELD_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"字段显示名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"POSITION\",\"meaning\":\"显示区域\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DEFAULT_VALUE\",\"meaning\":\"默认值\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DATA_OPTIONS\",\"meaning\":\"可选值JSON\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"ORDER_NUM\",\"meaning\":\"排序号\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_cms_model_item\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_model_item_base.FIELD = lm_cms_model_item.FIELD\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.4,\"meaning\":\"基础字段定义可能被模型字段配置引用\"}]','8d6177bc989f8e96c106c4ef31b1bd9d','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:29','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:29'),
(1468271740404864,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_cms_site','lm_cms_site','站点配置表，存储多站点域名、模板和状态。','**lm_cms_site** — 站点配置表，存储多站点域名、模板和状态。\n\n存储站点名称、标识、域名、协议、模板路径、启停状态等信息。由后台站点管理维护。常见查询是按域名或站点标识定位站点，或获取可用站点列表。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `id` (pk) 站点主键\n- `site_status` (status) 站点状态 1:开启；0:关闭\n- `del_flag` (status) 删除标识\n- `create_time` (time) 创建时间\n- `update_time` (time) 更新时间\n- `site_name` (other) 站点名称\n- `site_key` (other) 站点标识\n- `domain` (other) 域名\n- `domain_alias` (other) 域名别名\n- `protocol` (other) 访问协议，如 http/https\n- `order_num` (other) 排序：ASC\n- `pc_tpl` (other) PC端模板路径\n- `mobile_tpl` (other) 移动端模板路径\n\n### 关联\n- lm_cms_site.id = lm_cms_content.SITE_ID [ai]\n- lm_cms_site.id = lm_cms_model.SITE_ID [ai]\n- lm_cms_site.id = lm_cms_site_visit.site_id [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- 查询可用站点通常需过滤 del_flag 和 site_status；del_flag 有效值未知。\n- domain_alias 多值格式未知。\n- pc_tpl、mobile_tpl 可能依赖 lm_cms_global_config.CONTEXT_PATH 解析。\n','[{\"field\":\"id\",\"meaning\":\"站点主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"site_status\",\"meaning\":\"站点状态 1:开启；0:关闭\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"del_flag\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"create_time\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"update_time\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"site_name\",\"meaning\":\"站点名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"site_key\",\"meaning\":\"站点标识\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"domain\",\"meaning\":\"域名\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"domain_alias\",\"meaning\":\"域名别名\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"protocol\",\"meaning\":\"访问协议，如 http/https\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"order_num\",\"meaning\":\"排序：ASC\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"pc_tpl\",\"meaning\":\"PC端模板路径\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"mobile_tpl\",\"meaning\":\"移动端模板路径\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_cms_content\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_site.id = lm_cms_content.SITE_ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.8,\"meaning\":\"站点下内容\"},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_model\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_site.id = lm_cms_model.SITE_ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"meaning\":\"站点下模型\"},{\"table\":\"lm_cms_site_visit\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_site.id = lm_cms_site_visit.site_id\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"meaning\":\"站点访问统计\"}]','cb797f11404776acf9ddcbce05351e09','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:30','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:29'),
(1468271747441792,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_cms_site_visit','lm_cms_site_visit','站点按日访问量统计表。','**lm_cms_site_visit** — 站点按日访问量统计表。\n\n存储每个站点每日PV统计。由统计任务或访问日志汇总写入。常见查询是按站点和日期范围查看访问趋势。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `id` (pk) 主键\n- `site_id` (fk) 站点ID\n- `stat_date` (time) 统计日期 yyyyMMdd\n- `pv` (amount) 当日访问量\n- `create_time` (time) 创建时间\n- `update_time` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_cms_site_visit.site_id = lm_cms_site.id [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- stat_date 是 yyyyMMdd 字符串，日期范围查询可用字符串比较或转换。\n- pv 为 bigint，表示数量。\n- 无删除标识。\n','[{\"field\":\"id\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"site_id\",\"meaning\":\"站点ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"stat_date\",\"meaning\":\"统计日期 yyyyMMdd\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"pv\",\"meaning\":\"当日访问量\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"create_time\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"update_time\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_cms_site\",\"onSql\":\"lm_cms_site_visit.site_id = lm_cms_site.id\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"meaning\":\"访问统计所属站点\"}]','11aab2196baed5e9552cf435e35c761b','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:31','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:29'),
(1468271753168000,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_es_cms_mapping','lm_es_cms_mapping','CMS内容与ES文档映射表。','**lm_es_cms_mapping** — CMS内容与ES文档映射表。\n\n存储内容ID与ES文档ID、标题和同步状态。由索引同步程序写入。常见查询是按内容ID查ES ID，或按状态排查索引同步问题。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `id` (pk) 主键\n- `content_id` (fk) 数据ID，疑似内容ID\n- `data_status` (status) 数据状态，枚举未知\n- `create_time` (time) 创建时间\n- `update_time` (time) 更新时间\n- `es_id` (other) ES文档ID\n- `title` (other) 数据标题\n\n### 关联\n- lm_es_cms_mapping.content_id = lm_cms_content.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- data_status 枚举含义未知。\n- content_id 为 int，lm_cms_content.ID 为 bigint，联表时注意类型。\n- es_id 为 ES 文档ID，不等同于内容ID。\n','[{\"field\":\"id\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"content_id\",\"meaning\":\"数据ID，疑似内容ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"data_status\",\"meaning\":\"数据状态，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"create_time\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"update_time\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"es_id\",\"meaning\":\"ES文档ID\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"title\",\"meaning\":\"数据标题\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_cms_content\",\"onSql\":\"lm_es_cms_mapping.content_id = lm_cms_content.ID\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"meaning\":\"ES映射关联CMS内容\"}]','152c08aa367a653e6378d2077fe672ec','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:32','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:29'),
(1468271759090816,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_forum_board','lm_forum_board','论坛板块表，存储板块名称、描述和状态。','**lm_forum_board** — 论坛板块表，存储板块名称、描述和状态。\n\n存储论坛板块基础信息、图标、排序和启停状态。由论坛管理员维护。常见查询是获取启用板块列表或板块详情。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 板块主键\n- `STATUS` (status) 状态：0-停用，1-启用\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n- `BOARD_NAME` (other) 板块名称\n- `DESCRIPTION` (other) 板块描述\n- `ICON` (other) 板块图标\n- `SORT_NO` (other) 排序号\n\n### 关联\n\n### 注意事项\n- 查询可用板块通常需过滤 STATUS=1。\n- 表内无删除标识。\n- 输入中未提供帖子表，无法确认板块与帖子的关联字段。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"板块主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"状态：0-停用，1-启用\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"BOARD_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"板块名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DESCRIPTION\",\"meaning\":\"板块描述\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"ICON\",\"meaning\":\"板块图标\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"SORT_NO\",\"meaning\":\"排序号\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[]','9d3d03420a8f79fe1c1bd55aa1ad4a1b','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:32','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:29'),
(1468271764825216,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_forum_comment','lm_forum_comment','论坛评论表，存储帖子评论和回复。','**lm_forum_comment** — 论坛评论表，存储帖子评论和回复。\n\n存储评论正文、图片、点赞数、审核状态和父子回复关系。由用户发布或审核后台维护。常见查询是按帖子、用户、父评论和审核状态检索评论。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 评论主键\n- `POST_ID` (fk) 帖子ID，目标表未在输入中给出\n- `USER_ID` (fk) 用户ID，目标表未在输入中给出\n- `PARENT_ID` (fk) 父评论ID，0表示顶级评论\n- `REPLY_USER_ID` (fk) 回复目标用户ID\n- `AUDIT_STATUS` (status) 审核状态：0-待审核，1-审核通过，2-审核不通过\n- `STATUS` (status) 状态：0-已删除，1-正常\n- `LIKE_COUNT` (amount) 点赞次数\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n- `CONTENT` (other) 评论内容\n- `IMAGES` (other) 图片地址，多个用逗号分隔\n\n### 关联\n- lm_forum_comment.PARENT_ID = lm_forum_comment.ID [ai]\n- lm_forum_like.TARGET_ID = lm_forum_comment.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- STATUS=0 表示已删除，查询正常评论通常需过滤 STATUS=1。\n- AUDIT_STATUS 枚举已明确：0待审核、1通过、2不通过。\n- PARENT_ID=0 表示顶级评论。\n- POST_ID、USER_ID、REPLY_USER_ID 的目标表未在输入中给出。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"评论主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"POST_ID\",\"meaning\":\"帖子ID，目标表未在输入中给出\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"USER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"用户ID，目标表未在输入中给出\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"PARENT_ID\",\"meaning\":\"父评论ID，0表示顶级评论\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"REPLY_USER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"回复目标用户ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"AUDIT_STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"审核状态：0-待审核，1-审核通过，2-审核不通过\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"状态：0-已删除，1-正常\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"LIKE_COUNT\",\"meaning\":\"点赞次数\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"CONTENT\",\"meaning\":\"评论内容\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"IMAGES\",\"meaning\":\"图片地址，多个用逗号分隔\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_forum_comment\",\"onSql\":\"lm_forum_comment.PARENT_ID = lm_forum_comment.ID\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"meaning\":\"评论父级回复\"},{\"table\":\"lm_forum_like\",\"onSql\":\"lm_forum_like.TARGET_ID = lm_forum_comment.ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"meaning\":\"评论点赞记录，需过滤 TARGET_TYPE=2\"}]','31d30221b4f074cbbfe6d9e821752fed','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:33','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:29'),
(1468271770936448,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_forum_like','lm_forum_like','论坛点赞表，记录用户对帖子或评论点赞。','**lm_forum_like** — 论坛点赞表，记录用户对帖子或评论点赞。\n\n存储点赞用户、目标类型、目标ID和点赞状态。由用户交互写入。常见查询是统计帖子或评论点赞数，或判断用户是否已点赞。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `USER_ID` (fk) 用户ID，目标表未在输入中给出\n- `TARGET_TYPE` (status) 目标类型：1-帖子，2-评论\n- `TARGET_ID` (fk) 目标ID，根据 TARGET_TYPE 指向帖子或评论\n- `STATUS` (status) 状态：0-已取消，1-已点赞\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_forum_like.TARGET_ID = lm_forum_comment.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- TARGET_TYPE 枚举已明确：1帖子、2评论。\n- STATUS=0 表示取消点赞，统计有效点赞通常需过滤 STATUS=1。\n- TARGET_ID 是通用目标ID，必须结合 TARGET_TYPE 判断关联表。\n- 帖子表未在输入中给出，无法确认 TARGET_TYPE=1 的目标表。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"USER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"用户ID，目标表未在输入中给出\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"TARGET_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"目标类型：1-帖子，2-评论\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"TARGET_ID\",\"meaning\":\"目标ID，根据 TARGET_TYPE 指向帖子或评论\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"状态：0-已取消，1-已点赞\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_forum_comment\",\"onSql\":\"lm_forum_like.TARGET_ID = lm_forum_comment.ID\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"meaning\":\"点赞目标为评论，需过滤 TARGET_TYPE=2\"}]','46885cf97d8ded48c0235801e6942837','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:46:34','yan','2026-09-06 17:33:29'),
