(1468272113173632,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_vq_table_relationship','lm_vq_table_relationship','存储数据库表间关联关系配置。','**lm_vq_table_relationship** — 存储数据库表间关联关系配置。\n\n存储可视化或数据模型中源表与目标表的关联关系。由数据建模或配置模块维护。常用于查询表关系、生成JOIN或展示关系图。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `SOURCE_TABLE_ID` (other) 源表ID，关联未知表ID\n- `TARGET_TABLE_ID` (other) 目标表ID，关联未知表ID\n- `RELATIONSHIP_TYPE` (other) 关系类型，枚举未知\n- `JOIN_TYPE` (other) 连接类型，枚举未知\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标识，枚举未知\n- `DB_CONFIG_ID` (other) 所属数据库配置ID，关联未知表ID\n- `RELATIONSHIP_ID` (other) 业务关系码\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n\n### 注意事项\n- DEL_FLAG 可能用于软删除，查询前需确认枚举含义并过滤。\n- SOURCE_TABLE_ID/TARGET_TABLE_ID 指向的表结构未知，不能直接假设外键。\n- RELATIONSHIP_TYPE、JOIN_TYPE、DEL_FLAG 枚举含义未知。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"SOURCE_TABLE_ID\",\"meaning\":\"源表ID，关联未知表ID\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"TARGET_TABLE_ID\",\"meaning\":\"目标表ID，关联未知表ID\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"RELATIONSHIP_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"关系类型，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"JOIN_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"连接类型，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标识，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"DB_CONFIG_ID\",\"meaning\":\"所属数据库配置ID，关联未知表ID\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"RELATIONSHIP_ID\",\"meaning\":\"业务关系码\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[]','f5166aff9ad48d503a9c37d943fcef24','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:16','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:21'),
(1468272119235712,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_word2md_history','lm_word2md_history','记录Word与Markdown互转历史。','**lm_word2md_history** — 记录Word与Markdown互转历史。\n\n存储用户Word与Markdown互转的输入输出、文件路径、标题和目录。由转换服务按次写入。常用于查询用户转换历史、按目录或类型筛选和回溯文件。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `USER_ID` (fk) 用户ID，关联用户表未知\n- `CONVERT_TYPE` (other) 转换类型：word2md / md2word\n- `WORD_FILE_PATH` (other) Word文件保存路径，含义随转换类型变化\n- `MD_CONTENT` (other) Markdown内容，含义随转换类型变化\n- `TITLE` (other) Word文档标题，用于历史列表展示\n- `FOLDER_ID` (other) 目录ID，可能对应目录树JSON中的节点\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_word2md_history.USER_ID = lm_word2md_user_tree.USER_ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- CONVERT_TYPE 决定 WORD_FILE_PATH 和 MD_CONTENT 的业务含义：word2md时路径为上传、内容为结果；md2word时路径为生成、内容为输入。\n- MD_CONTENT 为 longtext，避免 SELECT *。\n- FOLDER_ID 与 lm_word2md_user_tree.TREE_JSON 内目录ID可能相关，但无直接外键。\n- 无明确软删除字段。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"USER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"用户ID，关联用户表未知\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"CONVERT_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"转换类型：word2md / md2word\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"WORD_FILE_PATH\",\"meaning\":\"Word文件保存路径，含义随转换类型变化\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"MD_CONTENT\",\"meaning\":\"Markdown内容，含义随转换类型变化\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"TITLE\",\"meaning\":\"Word文档标题，用于历史列表展示\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"FOLDER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"目录ID，可能对应目录树JSON中的节点\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_word2md_user_tree\",\"onSql\":\"lm_word2md_history.USER_ID = lm_word2md_user_tree.USER_ID\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.5,\"meaning\":\"同一用户的Word2Md目录树与转换历史关联\"}]','0caae6c88e536215c5e674c4b4093547','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:16','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:21'),
(1468272125043840,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_word2md_user_tree','lm_word2md_user_tree','存储用户Word2Md虚拟目录树。','**lm_word2md_user_tree** — 存储用户Word2Md虚拟目录树。\n\n按用户存储Word2Md文件的虚拟目录树JSON。由用户操作目录时写入或更新。常用于加载用户目录树、统计目录节点。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `USER_ID` (fk) 用户ID，注释说明每个用户1条\n- `TREE_JSON` (other) 目录树JSON\n- `REMARK` (other) 备注\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_word2md_user_tree.USER_ID = lm_word2md_history.USER_ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- 注释说明每个用户1条，可能存在唯一约束但未知。\n- 目录ID和层级保存在TREE_JSON中，SQL无法直接按目录节点JOIN。\n- 无软删除字段。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"USER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"用户ID，注释说明每个用户1条\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"TREE_JSON\",\"meaning\":\"目录树JSON\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"REMARK\",\"meaning\":\"备注\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_word2md_history\",\"onSql\":\"lm_word2md_user_tree.USER_ID = lm_word2md_history.USER_ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"meaning\":\"用户目录树与用户转换历史关联\"}]','d6fad16fb574d8d73a325858a41a3950','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:17','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:21'),
(1468272131064960,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_zi_wei_ai_analysis_report','lm_zi_wei_ai_analysis_report','存储紫微AI命盘分析报告。','**lm_zi_wei_ai_analysis_report** — 存储紫微AI命盘分析报告。\n\n存储会员或人员命盘在紫微AI分析中生成的报告、参数、结果和查看统计。由AI分析服务写入。常用于按会员、人员、分析类型、时间参数查询报告或缓存去重。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `MEMBER_ID` (fk) 会员ID\n- `PERSON_ID` (fk) 人员ID\n- `ANALYSIS_TYPE` (other) 分析类型：birth/daxian/liunian/liuyue/liuri/liushi\n- `API_TYPE` (other) 接口类型：SIHUA/FEIXING/SANHE\n- `PAN_TYPE` (other) 盘的类型：tianpan/dipan/renpan\n- `GONG_POSITION` (other) 宫位，0-11\n- `PALACE_NAME` (other) 宫位名称\n- `DA_XIAN_ORDER` (other) 大限顺序\n- `LIU_NIAN` (other) 流年年份\n- `LIU_YUE` (other) 流月\n- `LIU_RI` (other) 流日\n- `LIU_SHI` (other) 流时\n- `param_hash` (other) 参数哈希，SHA-256\n- `ANALYSIS_RESULT` (other) AI分析结果文本\n- `KEY_POINTS` (other) 关键信息摘要，JSON格式\n- `SUGGESTIONS` (other) 建议和提醒，JSON格式\n- `CONTEXT_INFO` (other) 流盘上下文信息，JSON格式\n- `ANALYSIS_TIME` (time) 分析时间\n- `VIEW_COUNT` (amount) 查看次数\n- `LAST_VIEW_TIME` (time) 最后查看时间\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标志：0代表存在，1代表删除\n- `result_json` (other) AI分析完整结果，JSON格式\n\n### 关联\n- lm_zi_wei_ai_analysis_report.PERSON_ID = lm_zi_wei_chat_session.PERSON_ID [ai]\n- lm_zi_wei_ai_analysis_report.MEMBER_ID = lm_zi_wei_chat_session.USER_ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- DEL_FLAG=0 表示存在，查询有效报告需过滤。\n- VIEW_COUNT 是次数不是金额。\n- LIU_NIAN/LIU_YUE/LIU_RI/LIU_SHI 是否有效取决于 ANALYSIS_TYPE。\n- param_hash 用于参数去重或缓存，具体唯一性未知。\n- 大文本字段较多，列表查询应避免 SELECT *。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"MEMBER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"会员ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"PERSON_ID\",\"meaning\":\"人员ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"ANALYSIS_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"分析类型：birth/daxian/liunian/liuyue/liuri/liushi\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"API_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"接口类型：SIHUA/FEIXING/SANHE\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"PAN_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"盘的类型：tianpan/dipan/renpan\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"GONG_POSITION\",\"meaning\":\"宫位，0-11\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"PALACE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"宫位名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DA_XIAN_ORDER\",\"meaning\":\"大限顺序\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"LIU_NIAN\",\"meaning\":\"流年年份\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"LIU_YUE\",\"meaning\":\"流月\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"LIU_RI\",\"meaning\":\"流日\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"LIU_SHI\",\"meaning\":\"流时\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"param_hash\",\"meaning\":\"参数哈希，SHA-256\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"ANALYSIS_RESULT\",\"meaning\":\"AI分析结果文本\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"KEY_POINTS\",\"meaning\":\"关键信息摘要，JSON格式\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"SUGGESTIONS\",\"meaning\":\"建议和提醒，JSON格式\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CONTEXT_INFO\",\"meaning\":\"流盘上下文信息，JSON格式\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"ANALYSIS_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"分析时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"VIEW_COUNT\",\"meaning\":\"查看次数\",\"role\":\"amount\"},{\"field\":\"LAST_VIEW_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"最后查看时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标志：0代表存在，1代表删除\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"result_json\",\"meaning\":\"AI分析完整结果，JSON格式\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_chat_session\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_ai_analysis_report.PERSON_ID = lm_zi_wei_chat_session.PERSON_ID\",\"type\":\"N:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.6,\"meaning\":\"分析报告与命盘人员会话通过人员ID关联\"},{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_chat_session\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_ai_analysis_report.MEMBER_ID = lm_zi_wei_chat_session.USER_ID\",\"type\":\"N:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.4,\"meaning\":\"会员ID可能与会话用户ID为同一用户体系\"}]','b1f0070b492ba3c851455cee26735877','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:18','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:21'),
(1468272136905856,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_zi_wei_basic_info','lm_zi_wei_basic_info','存储紫微斗数基础知识点。','**lm_zi_wei_basic_info** — 存储紫微斗数基础知识点。\n\n存储紫微斗数门派基础知识点和排序信息。由后台或知识运营维护。常用于按门派、启用状态查询知识点。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `SCHOOL_TYPE` (other) 所属门派：三合、四化、通用\n- `TITLE` (other) 标题\n- `KNOWLEDGE_POINT` (other) 知识点\n- `SORT_ORDER` (other) 排序号，越小越靠前\n- `STATUS` (status) 状态：1启用，0禁用\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n\n### 注意事项\n- 查询通常需 STATUS=1。\n- SCHOOL_TYPE 为中文枚举。\n- 无软删除字段。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"SCHOOL_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"所属门派：三合、四化、通用\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"TITLE\",\"meaning\":\"标题\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"KNOWLEDGE_POINT\",\"meaning\":\"知识点\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"SORT_ORDER\",\"meaning\":\"排序号，越小越靠前\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"状态：1启用，0禁用\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[]','1037f3fdde862c4e1e3408e928ea0419','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:19','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:21'),
(1468272142648448,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_zi_wei_chat_message','lm_zi_wei_chat_message','存储紫微AI对话消息明细。','**lm_zi_wei_chat_message** — 存储紫微AI对话消息明细。\n\n存储紫微AI会话中的用户提问、AI回答、思考过程和意图识别结果。由对话服务按轮次写入。常用于按会话加载历史消息和排序。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `SESSION_ID` (fk) 所属会话ID\n- `user_content` (other) 用户提问内容\n- `answer` (other) AI回答内容\n- `MSG_ORDER` (other) 消息序号，从1开始\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `THINKING_CONTENT` (other) AI思考过程\n- `INTENT_JSON_TEXT` (other) 意图识别原文JSON\n\n### 关联\n- lm_zi_wei_chat_message.SESSION_ID = lm_zi_wei_chat_session.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- 按 SESSION_ID 和 MSG_ORDER 排序读取。\n- 消息表无删除字段，查询有效消息需关联 lm_zi_wei_chat_session.DEL_FLAG=0。\n- user_content、answer、INTENT_JSON_TEXT 为大字段。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"SESSION_ID\",\"meaning\":\"所属会话ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"user_content\",\"meaning\":\"用户提问内容\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"answer\",\"meaning\":\"AI回答内容\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"MSG_ORDER\",\"meaning\":\"消息序号，从1开始\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"THINKING_CONTENT\",\"meaning\":\"AI思考过程\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"INTENT_JSON_TEXT\",\"meaning\":\"意图识别原文JSON\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_chat_session\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_chat_message.SESSION_ID = lm_zi_wei_chat_session.ID\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"meaning\":\"消息属于会话\"}]','733d266706690371460346616093de55','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:19','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:21'),
(1468272149021824,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_zi_wei_chat_session','lm_zi_wei_chat_session','存储紫微AI对话会话主信息。','**lm_zi_wei_chat_session** — 存储紫微AI对话会话主信息。\n\n存储用户与命盘人员之间的紫微AI对话会话、标题、人员快照和记忆摘要。由用户创建会话或AI更新摘要时写入。常用于会话列表、软删除过滤和消息入口。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `USER_ID` (fk) 用户ID\n- `PERSON_ID` (fk) 命盘人员ID\n- `PERSON_NAME` (other) 命盘人员姓名\n- `LUNAR_BIRTH_DATE` (other) 命盘农历生日\n- `GENDER` (other) 命盘性别，枚举未知\n- `TITLE` (other) 对话标题\n- `DEL_FLAG` (status) 删除标志：0正常，1删除\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n- `MEMORY_DIGEST` (other) 会话记忆摘要\n\n### 关联\n- lm_zi_wei_chat_session.ID = lm_zi_wei_chat_message.SESSION_ID [ai]\n- lm_zi_wei_chat_session.PERSON_ID = lm_zi_wei_ai_analysis_report.PERSON_ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- DEL_FLAG=0 查询有效会话。\n- PERSON_NAME、LUNAR_BIRTH_DATE、GENDER 是会话内快照，可能与人员表当前值不一致。\n- MEMORY_DIGEST 为AI滚动蒸馏摘要，可能为空。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"USER_ID\",\"meaning\":\"用户ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"PERSON_ID\",\"meaning\":\"命盘人员ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"PERSON_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"命盘人员姓名\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"LUNAR_BIRTH_DATE\",\"meaning\":\"命盘农历生日\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"GENDER\",\"meaning\":\"命盘性别，枚举未知\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"TITLE\",\"meaning\":\"对话标题\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DEL_FLAG\",\"meaning\":\"删除标志：0正常，1删除\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"MEMORY_DIGEST\",\"meaning\":\"会话记忆摘要\",\"role\":\"other\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_chat_message\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_chat_session.ID = lm_zi_wei_chat_message.SESSION_ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"meaning\":\"会话包含多条消息\"},{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_ai_analysis_report\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_chat_session.PERSON_ID = lm_zi_wei_ai_analysis_report.PERSON_ID\",\"type\":\"N:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.6,\"meaning\":\"同一命盘人员可能有多份分析报告\"}]','b2257526245e1e4021665514fda6314d','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:20','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:22'),
(1468272155255936,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_zi_wei_cueword_global_settings','lm_zi_wei_cueword_global_settings','存储紫微Cueword全局默认配置。','**lm_zi_wei_cueword_global_settings** — 存储紫微Cueword全局默认配置。\n\n存储紫微Cueword全局默认提示词版本等配置。通常由管理后台维护，单行生效。常用于读取默认 prompt profile。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID，注释固定为1\n- `DEFAULT_PROMPT_PROFILE` (other) 全局默认提示词版本：legacy/v2/v3；NULL表示不覆盖配置文件\n- `REMARK` (other) 备注\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_zi_wei_cueword_global_settings.DEFAULT_PROMPT_PROFILE = lm_zi_wei_cueword_sihua_tmpl_direct.PROMPT_PROFILE [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- ID 注释固定为1，通常按单行读取。\n- DEFAULT_PROMPT_PROFILE 为 NULL 时可能表示不覆盖配置文件。\n- 无软删除字段。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID，注释固定为1\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"DEFAULT_PROMPT_PROFILE\",\"meaning\":\"全局默认提示词版本：legacy/v2/v3；NULL表示不覆盖配置文件\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"REMARK\",\"meaning\":\"备注\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_cueword_sihua_tmpl_direct\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_cueword_global_settings.DEFAULT_PROMPT_PROFILE = lm_zi_wei_cueword_sihua_tmpl_direct.PROMPT_PROFILE\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.5,\"meaning\":\"默认提示词版本与对应四化直出模板关联\"}]','c99c15bcbdbb9fb0d21a82304e64b144','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:21','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:22'),
(1468272161227904,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_zi_wei_cueword_sihua_tmpl_direct','lm_zi_wei_cueword_sihua_tmpl_direct','存储紫微四化模板直出规则。','**lm_zi_wei_cueword_sihua_tmpl_direct** — 存储紫微四化模板直出规则。\n\n按提示词版本存储紫微四化模板直出规则JSON。由模板配置或AI优化流程维护。常用于按当前 prompt profile 读取规则。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键\n- `PROMPT_PROFILE` (other) 提示词版本：v2/v3，注释为小写\n- `RULES_JSON` (other) 规则JSON\n- `REMARK` (other) 备注\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_zi_wei_cueword_sihua_tmpl_direct.PROMPT_PROFILE = lm_zi_wei_cueword_global_settings.DEFAULT_PROMPT_PROFILE [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- PROMPT_PROFILE 注释为小写 v2/v3。\n- RULES_JSON 为规则JSON，结构需参考业务代码。\n- 无状态或软删除字段，可能需按版本选择。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"PROMPT_PROFILE\",\"meaning\":\"提示词版本：v2/v3，注释为小写\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"RULES_JSON\",\"meaning\":\"规则JSON\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"REMARK\",\"meaning\":\"备注\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_cueword_global_settings\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_cueword_sihua_tmpl_direct.PROMPT_PROFILE = lm_zi_wei_cueword_global_settings.DEFAULT_PROMPT_PROFILE\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.5,\"meaning\":\"模板版本与全局默认版本关联\"}]','b699c6f04d0416089f61bf225093e667','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:22','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:22'),
(1468272167371904,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict','lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict','存储叠宫象意基础字典。','**lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict** — 存储叠宫象意基础字典。\n\n存储紫微叠宫类型、基础宫位、大运或流年宫位、顺逆行及各类象意文本。由知识运营维护。常用于按叠宫类型和宫位组合查询象意。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `DIE_GONG_TYPE` (other) 叠宫类型：大运、流年、流月、流日\n- `BASE_PALACE_NAME` (other) 基础宫位\n- `DAYUN_PALACE_NAME` (other) 大运宫位\n- `LIUNIAN_PALACE_NAME` (other) 流年宫位\n- `DIRECTION` (other) 顺逆行：顺行、逆行\n- `DIE_GONG_MEANING` (other) 叠宫象意\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict.ID = lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict_ai.REF_ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- 无状态或软删除字段，查询可能需按业务选择原表或AI优化表。\n- DIE_GONG_TYPE、DIRECTION 为中文枚举。\n- 象意文本字段较长，列表查询避免 SELECT *。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"DIE_GONG_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"叠宫类型：大运、流年、流月、流日\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"BASE_PALACE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"基础宫位\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DAYUN_PALACE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"大运宫位\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"LIUNIAN_PALACE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"流年宫位\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DIRECTION\",\"meaning\":\"顺逆行：顺行、逆行\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DIE_GONG_MEANING\",\"meaning\":\"叠宫象意\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict_ai\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict.ID = lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict_ai.REF_ID\",\"type\":\"1:N\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"meaning\":\"原叠宫字典与AI优化版关联\"}]','c2d40f0fd1683df986d6ee0a5c04cf95','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:22','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:22'),
(1468272173597824,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict_ai','lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict_ai','存储叠宫字典AI优化结果。','**lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict_ai** — 存储叠宫字典AI优化结果。\n\n存储原叠宫字典的AI优化象意和备注，通过REF_ID关联原表。由AI优化流程或后台维护。常用于查询AI优化后的叠宫解释。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `REF_ID` (fk) 原表关联ID，指向 lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict.ID\n- `DIE_GONG_TYPE` (other) 叠宫类型\n- `BASE_PALACE_NAME` (other) 基础宫位\n- `DAYUN_PALACE_NAME` (other) 大运宫位\n- `LIUNIAN_PALACE_NAME` (other) 流年宫位\n- `DIRECTION` (other) 顺逆行\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict_ai.REF_ID = lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict.ID [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- REF_ID 指向原表ID，原表名注释为大写，实际表名为小写。\n- 可能存在同一原字典多条AI优化记录，需按时间或版本选择。\n- 无状态或软删除字段。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"REF_ID\",\"meaning\":\"原表关联ID，指向 lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict.ID\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"DIE_GONG_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"叠宫类型\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"BASE_PALACE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"基础宫位\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DAYUN_PALACE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"大运宫位\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"LIUNIAN_PALACE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"流年宫位\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"DIRECTION\",\"meaning\":\"顺逆行\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict_ai.REF_ID = lm_zi_wei_diegong_palace_dict.ID\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"meaning\":\"AI优化版回连原字典\"}]','e59d9054aa796f4fa433db746dfa86d7','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:23','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:22'),
(1468272180593792,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_zi_wei_fa_xiang_hui_gui_dict','lm_zi_wei_fa_xiang_hui_gui_dict','存储法象回归生年象意字典。','**lm_zi_wei_fa_xiang_hui_gui_dict** — 存储法象回归生年象意字典。\n\n存储生年四化与飞宫四化的法象回归象意字典。由知识运营维护。常用于按生年四化星辰、宫位、类型和飞宫条件查询象义。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `SHENGNIAN_SIHUA_STAR_NAME` (other) 生年四化星辰名称\n- `SHENGNIAN_SIHUA_PALACE_NAME` (other) 生年四化宫位名称\n- `SHENGNIAN_SIHUA_TYPE` (other) 生年四化类型：禄、权、科、忌\n- `FEI_GONG_PALACE_NAME` (other) 飞宫宫位名称\n- `FEI_GONG_SIHUA_STAR_NAME` (other) 飞宫四化星辰名称\n- `STATUS` (status) 状态：1启用，0禁用\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n\n### 注意事项\n- 查询通常需 STATUS=1。\n- SHENGNIAN_SIHUA_TYPE 为中文枚举。\n- 象义文本字段较长，列表查询避免 SELECT *。\n- 无软删除字段。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"SHENGNIAN_SIHUA_STAR_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"生年四化星辰名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"SHENGNIAN_SIHUA_PALACE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"生年四化宫位名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"SHENGNIAN_SIHUA_TYPE\",\"meaning\":\"生年四化类型：禄、权、科、忌\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"FEI_GONG_PALACE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"飞宫宫位名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"FEI_GONG_SIHUA_STAR_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"飞宫四化星辰名称\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"状态：1启用，0禁用\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[]','bf4960d07691fd46f4c0c4b11aeb2df8','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:24','yan','2026-09-06 17:46:22'),
(1468272186991744,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_zi_wei_feigong_palace_dict','lm_zi_wei_feigong_palace_dict','存储飞宫化象字典与象义文本','**lm_zi_wei_feigong_palace_dict** — 存储飞宫化象字典与象义文本\n\n存储飞宫、向心、离心自化等象义文本。由命理内容编辑维护。常用于按基础宫位和飞宫宫位查询象义。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `BASE_PALACE_NAME` (fk) 基础宫位，可关联宫位字典\n- `FEI_GONG_PALACE_NAME` (fk) 飞宫宫位，可关联宫位字典\n- `STATUS` (status) 状态：1启用，0禁用\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_zi_wei_feigong_palace_dict.BASE_PALACE_NAME = lm_zi_wei_palace_dict.PALACE_NAME [ai]\n- lm_zi_wei_feigong_palace_dict.FEI_GONG_PALACE_NAME = lm_zi_wei_palace_dict.PALACE_NAME [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- 查询通常需过滤 STATUS=1。\n- 多个象义字段为 text，避免 SELECT *。\n- 宫位名称需与宫位字典保持一致。\n- 无软删除字段。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"BASE_PALACE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"基础宫位，可关联宫位字典\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"FEI_GONG_PALACE_NAME\",\"meaning\":\"飞宫宫位，可关联宫位字典\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"状态：1启用，0禁用\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_palace_dict\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_feigong_palace_dict.BASE_PALACE_NAME = lm_zi_wei_palace_dict.PALACE_NAME\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"meaning\":\"基础宫位对应通用宫位名称\"},{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_palace_dict\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_feigong_palace_dict.FEI_GONG_PALACE_NAME = lm_zi_wei_palace_dict.PALACE_NAME\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"meaning\":\"飞宫宫位对应通用宫位名称\"}]','a679814db92ce776c4bfbc91c3c8a8eb','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:25','yan','2026-09-06 17:49:52'),
(1468272192914560,1,'lemon_cms','TABLE','default','未分组','lm_zi_wei_laiyin_dict','lm_zi_wei_laiyin_dict','存储来因宫四化象义字典','**lm_zi_wei_laiyin_dict** — 存储来因宫四化象义字典\n\n存储来因宫、四化星、四化星宫位、性别及基础/四化/自化象义。由命理编辑维护。用于按来因宫、四化星、性别查询解释。\n\n### 关键字段\n- `ID` (pk) 主键ID\n- `LAIYIN_PALACE` (fk) 来因所在宫位，可关联来因宫位字典\n- `SIHUA_STAR` (fk) 四化星辰，可关联星耀基础表\n- `SIHUA_STAR_PALACE` (fk) 四化星辰所在宫位，可关联宫位字典\n- `GENDER` (other) 命主性别：男、女\n- `STATUS` (status) 数据状态：0-禁用，1-启用\n- `CREATE_TIME` (time) 创建时间\n- `UPDATE_TIME` (time) 更新时间\n\n### 关联\n- lm_zi_wei_laiyin_dict.LAIYIN_PALACE = lm_zi_wei_laiyin_palace_dict.PALACE_NAME [ai]\n- lm_zi_wei_laiyin_dict.SIHUA_STAR_PALACE = lm_zi_wei_palace_dict.PALACE_NAME [ai]\n- lm_zi_wei_laiyin_dict.SIHUA_STAR = lm_zi_wei_star_base.STAR_NAME [ai]\n\n### 注意事项\n- 查询通常需过滤 STATUS=1。\n- GENDER 枚举通常为男、女。\n- 多个象义字段为 text，避免 SELECT *。\n- 无软删除字段。\n','[{\"field\":\"ID\",\"meaning\":\"主键ID\",\"role\":\"pk\"},{\"field\":\"LAIYIN_PALACE\",\"meaning\":\"来因所在宫位，可关联来因宫位字典\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"SIHUA_STAR\",\"meaning\":\"四化星辰，可关联星耀基础表\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"SIHUA_STAR_PALACE\",\"meaning\":\"四化星辰所在宫位，可关联宫位字典\",\"role\":\"fk\"},{\"field\":\"GENDER\",\"meaning\":\"命主性别：男、女\",\"role\":\"other\"},{\"field\":\"STATUS\",\"meaning\":\"数据状态：0-禁用，1-启用\",\"role\":\"status\"},{\"field\":\"CREATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"创建时间\",\"role\":\"time\"},{\"field\":\"UPDATE_TIME\",\"meaning\":\"更新时间\",\"role\":\"time\"}]','[{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_laiyin_palace_dict\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_laiyin_dict.LAIYIN_PALACE = lm_zi_wei_laiyin_palace_dict.PALACE_NAME\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.6,\"meaning\":\"来因宫位对应来因十二宫字典\"},{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_palace_dict\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_laiyin_dict.SIHUA_STAR_PALACE = lm_zi_wei_palace_dict.PALACE_NAME\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.6,\"meaning\":\"四化星辰所在宫位对应通用宫位字典\"},{\"table\":\"lm_zi_wei_star_base\",\"onSql\":\"lm_zi_wei_laiyin_dict.SIHUA_STAR = lm_zi_wei_star_base.STAR_NAME\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\"