ALACE = lm_zi_wei_palace_dict.PALACE_NAME\",\"type\":\"N:1\",\"source\":\"ai\",\"confidence\":0.6,\"meaning\":\"四化星辰所在宫位对应通用宫位字典\"}]','29cbfdeb020f8c92d5c94588a5691b46','ai','ACTIVE',2,1467891621250176,0,0,'yan','2026-09-06 10:47:26','yan','2026-09-06 17:49:52'),
